umber exactly as it appears on your land-claims card.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez votre numéro de bénéficiaire ou d\'inscription exactement comme il apparaît sur votre carte de revendications territoriales.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Inuit enrolment or beneficiary number\", \"fr\": \"Numéro d’inscription ou de bénéficiaire inuit\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"legal-indigenous-identity\", \"value\": \"inuit\"}, {\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"has_reg_number\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--l\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"inuit-registration-number\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter your Inuit enrolment or beneficiary number.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez saisir votre numéro d’inscription ou de bénéficiaire inuit.\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"registration-number\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"home-community\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Home Community\", \"fr\": \"Home Community\"}, \"stepId\": \"home-community\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"home-comminuty\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you would like, tell us the First Nation, Inuit, or Métis community you consider home.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous le souhaitez, indiquez la Première Nation, la communauté inuit ou la communauté métisse que vous considérez comme votre communauté d’origine.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your home community?\", \"fr\": \"Quelle est votre communauté d’origine ?\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"{indigenous-affiliation-declaration}\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--l\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"home-comminuty\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"demographics\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Demographics\", \"fr\": \"Demographics\"}, \"stepId\": \"demographics\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Additional information\", \"fr\": \"Renseignements complémentaires\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This information helps us understand your household circumstances and support equitable access to services. We ask only for information that is relevant to your application.\", \"fr\": \"Ces renseignements nous aident à comprendre la situation de votre ménage et à soutenir un accès équitable aux services. Nous demandons seulement l’information pertinente à votre demande.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"preferred-language\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"We will use this language when we contact you whenever possible.\", \"fr\": \"Nous utiliserons cette langue lorsque nous communiquerons avec vous, dans la mesure du possible.\"}, \"name\": \"preferred-language\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Which language would you like us to use when we contact you?\", \"fr\": \"Quelle langue souhaitez-vous que nous utilisions pour communiquer avec vous ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"English\", \"fr\": \"Anglais\"}, \"value\": \"en\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"French\", \"fr\": \"Français\"}, \"value\": \"fr\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"preferred-language\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select a language.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner une langue.\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"visible-minority\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"This question is used for federal reporting only.\", \"fr\": \"Cette question est utilisée uniquement pour la déclaration fédérale.\"}, \"name\": \"visible-minority\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"For federal reporting, other than Indigenous identity, do you identify as a member of a visible minority group?\", \"fr\": \"Pour la déclaration fédérale, outre l’identité autochtone, vous identifiez-vous comme membre d’un groupe de minorité visible ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"true\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"false\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"storageKey\": \"visible-minority\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select yes or no.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner oui ou non.\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"marital-status\", \"name\": \"marital-status\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your marital status?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est votre état civil ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Married or common-law\", \"fr\": \"Marié(e) ou conjoint(e) de fait\"}, \"value\": \"married\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"spouses-name\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Only complete this if it applies to you.\", \"fr\": \"Remplissez ce champ seulement si cela s’applique à vous.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spouse or partner’s name\", \"fr\": \"Nom du conjoint, de la conjointe ou du partenaire\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"spouses-name\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us your spouse or partner’s name.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez indiquer le nom de votre conjoint, de votre conjointe ou de votre partenaire.\"}}}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Single\", \"fr\": \"Célibataire\"}, \"value\": \"single\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Separated\", \"fr\": \"Séparé(e)\"}, \"value\": \"separated\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Divorced\", \"fr\": \"Divorcé(e)\"}, \"value\": \"divorced\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Widowed\", \"fr\": \"Veuf ou veuve\"}, \"value\": \"widowed\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"marital-status\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select your marital status.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner votre état civil.\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"dependent-children\", \"name\": \"dependent-children\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Do you currently have dependent children?\", \"fr\": \"Avez-vous actuellement des enfants à charge ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"ages-of-children\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"List the ages of your children separated by commas (e.g., 4, 7, 13).\", \"fr\": \"Listez les âges de vos enfants séparés par des virgules (ex. : 4, 7, 13).\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Children’s ages\", \"fr\": \"Âge des enfants\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"ages-of-children\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us the ages of your children.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez indiquer l’âge de vos enfants.\"}}}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"storageKey\": \"dependent-children\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select yes or no.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner oui ou non.\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"disability-and-social-assistance\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Disability and Social Assistance\", \"fr\": \"Disability and Social Assistance\"}, \"stepId\": \"disability-and-social-assistance\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Support needs and social assistance\", \"fr\": \"Besoins de soutien et aide sociale\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"We ask these questions only to understand whether you may need accommodations or other supports during your plan.\", \"fr\": \"Nous posons ces questions uniquement pour comprendre si vous pourriez avoir besoin de mesures d’adaptation ou d’autres soutiens pendant votre parcours.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"has-disability\", \"name\": \"has-disability\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Do you identify as a person with a disability, or do you have a disability-related support need?\", \"fr\": \"Vous identifiez-vous comme une personne en situation de handicap, ou avez-vous un besoin de soutien lié à un handicap ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"disability-description\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Only share what you are comfortable sharing. A short description of the support or accommodation you need is enough.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez seulement ce que vous êtes à l’aise de partager. Une courte description du soutien ou de la mesure d’adaptation dont vous avez besoin suffit.\"}, \"rows\": 5, \"type\": \"character-count\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us about any disability-related support needs\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez décrire tout besoin de soutien lié à un handicap\"}, \"required\": true, \"maxLength\": 200, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"threshold\": 75, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"storageKey\": \"disability-description\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us about the support or accommodation you need.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez décrire le soutien ou la mesure d’adaptation dont vous avez besoin.\"}}}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"storageKey\": \"has-disability\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"social-assistance\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Choose the option that best describes your situation.\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez l’option qui décrit le mieux votre situation.\"}, \"name\": \"social-assistance\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Are you currently receiving social assistance or income assistance?\", \"fr\": \"Recevez-vous actuellement de l’aide sociale ou un soutien du revenu ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"top-up-amount\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Enter the monthly amount you are allowed to receive in addition to your social assistance benefits. Leave this blank if you are unsure.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez le montant mensuel que vous avez le droit de recevoir en plus de vos prestations d’aide sociale. Laissez ce champ vide si vous n’êtes pas certain(e).\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"If you know it, what is your allowable top-up amount?\", \"fr\": \"Si vous le connaissez, quel est votre montant maximal permis ?\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"top-up-amount\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"storageKey\": \"social-assistance\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"labour-force-and-education-history\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Labour Force and Education History\", \"fr\": \"Labour Force and Education History\"}, \"stepId\": \"labour-force-and-education-history\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Employment and education history\", \"fr\": \"Parcours d’emploi et de formation\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about your current work or study situation and the highest level of education you have completed.\", \"fr\": \"Parlez-nous de votre situation actuelle de travail ou d’études et du plus haut niveau d’études que vous avez terminé.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"labour-force-status\", \"name\": \"labour-force-status\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--small\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What best describes your current work or study situation?\", \"fr\": \"Quelle option décrit le mieux votre situation actuelle de travail ou d’études ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Unemployed\", \"fr\": \"Sans emploi\"}, \"value\": \"unemployed\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Underemployed\", \"fr\": \"En sous-emploi\"}, \"value\": \"underemployed\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Employed full-time\", \"fr\": \"En emploi à temps plein\"}, \"value\": \"employed-full-time\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Employed part-time\", \"fr\": \"En emploi à temps partiel\"}, \"value\": \"employed-part-time\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Employed on approved leave\", \"fr\": \"En emploi, en congé autorisé\"}, \"value\": \"employed-on-approved-leave\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-employed\", \"fr\": \"Travail autonome\"}, \"value\": \"self-employed\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Student\", \"fr\": \"Étudiant(e)\"}, \"value\": \"student\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"labour-force-status\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"highest-education\", \"name\": \"highest-education\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios--small\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is the highest level of education you have completed?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est le plus haut niveau d’études que vous avez terminé ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"No formal education\", \"fr\": \"Aucune éducation formelle\"}, \"value\": \"no_formal_education\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Up to Grade 7–8 (Secondaire I–II)\", \"fr\": \"Jusqu’à la 7e–8e année (Secondaire I–II)\"}, \"value\": \"grade_7_8\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Grade 9–10 (Secondaire III)\", \"fr\": \"9e–10e année (Secondaire III)\"}, \"value\": \"grade_9_10\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Grade 11–12 (Secondaire IV–V)\", \"fr\": \"11e–12e année (Secondaire IV–V)\"}, \"value\": \"grade_11_12\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Secondary School Diploma or GED\", \"fr\": \"Diplôme d’études secondaires ou GED\"}, \"value\": \"secondary_school_diploma_or_ged\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Some post-secondary training\", \"fr\": \"Certaines formations postsecondaires\"}, \"value\": \"post_secondary_training\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Apprenticeship/trades certificate or diploma\", \"fr\": \"Certificat ou diplôme d\'apprentissage/métiers\"}, \"value\": \"apprenticeship_trades\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"CEGEP or other non-university certificate/diploma\", \"fr\": \"DEC ou autre certificat/diplôme non universitaire\"}, \"value\": \"cegep\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"College or other non-university certificate/diploma\", \"fr\": \"Certificat ou diplôme collégial ou autre certificat/diplôme non universitaire\"}, \"value\": \"college\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"University certificate or diploma\", \"fr\": \"Certificat ou diplôme universitaire\"}, \"value\": \"university_certificate\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"University – Bachelor Degree\", \"fr\": \"Université – Baccalauréat\"}, \"value\": \"bachelors_degree\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"University – Master’s Degree\", \"fr\": \"Université – Maîtrise\"}, \"value\": \"masters_degree\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"University – Doctorate\", \"fr\": \"Université – Doctorat\"}, \"value\": \"doctorate\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"highest-education\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"education-year\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Leave this blank if it does not apply.\", \"fr\": \"Laissez ce champ vide si cela ne s’applique pas.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Year you completed your highest level of education\", \"fr\": \"Année où vous avez terminé votre plus haut niveau d’études\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"education-year\"}, {\"id\": \"education-location\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you completed your education outside Canada, select “Other country”.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez terminé vos études à l’extérieur du Canada, sélectionnez « Autre pays ».\"}, \"type\": \"select\", \"class\": \"govuk-select\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Province, territory, or country where you completed your highest level of education\", \"fr\": \"Province, territoire ou pays où vous avez terminé votre plus haut niveau d’études\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Alberta\", \"fr\": \"Alberta\"}, \"value\": \"ab\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"British Columbia\", \"fr\": \"Colombie-Britannique\"}, \"value\": \"bc\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Manitoba\", \"fr\": \"Manitoba\"}, \"value\": \"mb\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"New Brunswick\", \"fr\": \"Nouveau-Brunswick\"}, \"value\": \"nb\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Newfoundland and Labrador\", \"fr\": \"Terre-Neuve-et-Labrador\"}, \"value\": \"nl\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Nova Scotia\", \"fr\": \"Nouvelle-Écosse\"}, \"value\": \"ns\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Northwest Territories\", \"fr\": \"Territoires du Nord-Ouest\"}, \"value\": \"nt\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Nunavut\", \"fr\": \"Nunavut\"}, \"value\": \"nu\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Ontario\", \"fr\": \"Ontario\"}, \"value\": \"on\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Prince Edward Island\", \"fr\": \"Île-du-Prince-Édouard\"}, \"value\": \"pe\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Quebec\", \"fr\": \"Québec\"}, \"value\": \"qc\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Saskatchewan\", \"fr\": \"Saskatchewan\"}, \"value\": \"sk\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yukon\", \"fr\": \"Yukon\"}, \"value\": \"yt\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"United States\", \"fr\": \"États-Unis\"}, \"value\": \"us\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other country\", \"fr\": \"Autre pays\"}, \"value\": \"14\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"storageKey\": \"education-location\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"employment-goals-and-barriers\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Employment Goals and Barriers\", \"fr\": \"Employment Goals and Barriers\"}, \"stepId\": \"employment-goals-and-barriers\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Employment and training goals\", \"fr\": \"Objectifs d’emploi et de formation\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about the work or training you want to pursue and any supports that may help you get there.\", \"fr\": \"Parlez-nous du travail ou de la formation que vous souhaitez poursuivre et des soutiens qui pourraient vous aider à y parvenir.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"long-term-goal\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about the goal you want to work toward.\", \"fr\": \"Décrivez l’objectif vers lequel vous souhaitez progresser.\"}, \"rows\": 5, \"type\": \"character-count\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What work or training goal would you like ISET to support?\", \"fr\": \"Quel objectif de travail ou de formation souhaitez-vous que le programme ISET soutienne ?\"}, \"required\": false, \"maxLength\": 500, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"threshold\": 75, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"long-term-goal\"}, {\"id\": \"barriers\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les réponses qui s’appliquent.\"}, \"name\": \"barriers\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What challenges or circumstances may affect your training or employment plans right now?\", \"fr\": \"Quels défis ou quelles circonstances peuvent avoir une incidence sur vos projets de formation ou d’emploi en ce moment ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Education or training\", \"fr\": \"Éducation ou formation\"}, \"value\": \"education\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Funding or finances\", \"fr\": \"Financement ou finances\"}, \"value\": \"funding\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Limited local job opportunities\", \"fr\": \"Possibilités d’emploi limitées dans votre région\"}, \"value\": \"lack-of-job-opportunities\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Location or transportation\", \"fr\": \"Lieu de résidence ou transport\"}, \"value\": \"location\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"other-barrier\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about another challenge or support need.\", \"fr\": \"Décrivez un autre défi ou besoin de soutien.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other challenge (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Autre défi (veuillez préciser)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"other-barrier\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"barriers\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"target-program\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Choose the option that best fits where you are right now.\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez l’option qui correspond le mieux à votre situation actuelle.\"}, \"name\": \"target-program\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What kind of program or support are you interested in right now?\", \"fr\": \"Quel type de programme ou de soutien vous intéresse en ce moment ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Formal training such as college, university, or vocational courses that help you gain new skills or credentials.\", \"fr\": \"Formation formelle telle que collège, université ou cours professionnels qui vous aident à acquérir de nouvelles compétences ou qualifications.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Skills Development (Education)\", \"fr\": \"Développement des compétences (Éducation)\"}, \"value\": \"skills_development\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Support to help an employer hire you by covering part of your wages during a training or probation period.\", \"fr\": \"Soutien pour aider un employeur à vous embaucher en couvrant une partie de votre salaire durant une période de formation ou de probation.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Targeted Wage Subsidy\", \"fr\": \"Subvention salariale ciblée\"}, \"value\": \"tws\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Short-term work experience on a community or project-based initiative that builds your employability.\", \"fr\": \"Expérience de travail à court terme dans une initiative communautaire ou basée sur un projet qui développe votre employabilité.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Job Creation Partnership\", \"fr\": \"Partenariat de création d’emplois\"}, \"value\": \"jcp\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Training delivered to a group of participants with similar learning goals, often led by an employer or community partner.\", \"fr\": \"Formation offerte à un groupe de participants ayant des objectifs d\'apprentissage similaires, souvent dirigée par un employeur ou un partenaire communautaire.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Group Training\", \"fr\": \"Formation en groupe\"}, \"value\": \"group\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Assistance to start or grow your own business, including business planning or mentorship.\", \"fr\": \"Assistance pour démarrer ou développer votre propre entreprise, incluant la planification d\'affaires ou le mentorat.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-employment supports\", \"fr\": \"Soutien au travail autonome\"}, \"value\": \"self_support\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You have not yet chosen a specific program or employer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n\'avez pas encore choisi de programme ou d\'employeur spécifique.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Not yet\", \"fr\": \"Pas encore\"}, \"value\": \"not_yet\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"target-program\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Financial Supports Requested\", \"fr\": \"Financial Supports Requested\"}, \"stepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Supports requested\", \"fr\": \"Soutiens demandés\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us which supports would help you take part in your training or employment plan.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez les soutiens qui vous aideraient à participer à votre parcours de formation ou d’emploi.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"requested-supports\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les réponses qui s’appliquent.\"}, \"name\": \"requested-supports\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Which supports are you requesting at this time?\", \"fr\": \"Quels soutiens demandez-vous en ce moment ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for course or program tuition and mandatory fees\", \"fr\": \"Coûts liés aux frais de scolarité du cours ou du programme et aux frais obligatoires\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Tuition\", \"fr\": \"Frais de scolarité\"}, \"value\": \"tuition\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for textbooks, supplies, and other required learning materials\", \"fr\": \"Coûts pour les manuels, les fournitures et autres matériels d’apprentissage obligatoires\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Books and program materials\", \"fr\": \"Livres et matériel de programme\"}, \"value\": \"books\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for housing, groceries and basic utilities\", \"fr\": \"Coûts pour le logement, les courses et les services publics de base\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Living allowance\", \"fr\": \"Allocation de subsistance\"}, \"value\": \"living\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for commuting, transit passes, fuel, or other travel related to the program\", \"fr\": \"Coûts liés aux déplacements domicile‑études, aux laissez‑passer de transport en commun, au carburant ou à tout autre déplacement lié au programme\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transportation\", \"fr\": \"Transport\"}, \"value\": \"transportation\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for daycare, babysitting, or other dependent care while attending the program\", \"fr\": \"Coûts pour la garderie, le babysitting ou d’autres services de garde de personnes à charge pendant que vous suivez le programme\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Childcare\", \"fr\": \"Garde d’enfants\"}, \"value\": \"childcare\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Which options best describe your current childcare arrangement? Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Quelles options décrivent le mieux votre situation actuelle en matière de garde d’enfants ? Sélectionnez toutes les réponses qui s’appliquent.\"}, \"name\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Current childcare arrangement\", \"fr\": \"Situation actuelle en matière de garde d’enfants\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"No childcare funding received\", \"fr\": \"Aucun financement pour la garde d’enfants\"}, \"value\": \"no-funding-received\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"EI/CRF\", \"fr\": \"AE/CRF\"}, \"value\": \"ei-crf\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Provincial funding or subsidy\", \"fr\": \"Financement ou subvention provinciale\"}, \"value\": \"provincial-funding-subsidy\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"FNICCI\", \"fr\": \"FNICCI\"}, \"value\": \"fnicci\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No childcare spaces available\", \"fr\": \"Aucune place en service de garde disponible\"}, \"value\": \"daycare-not-available\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Supported by family\", \"fr\": \"Soutien de la famille\"}, \"value\": \"assisted-by-family\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-funded\", \"fr\": \"Autofinancement\"}, \"value\": \"self-funded\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}]}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Any other eligible education-related costs not listed above\", \"fr\": \"Tout autre coût admissible lié aux études qui n’est pas mentionné ci‑dessus\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"other-requested-support\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other support requested\", \"fr\": \"Autre soutien demandé\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"other-requested-support\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"requested-supports\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"disability-support\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you need disability-related supports to take part in training or education, tell us here. We may ask for medical or professional documentation later if it is needed to assess your request.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez besoin de soutiens liés à un handicap pour participer à une formation ou à des études, indiquez-le ici. Nous pourrions demander plus tard une documentation médicale ou professionnelle si elle est nécessaire pour évaluer votre demande.\"}, \"name\": \"disability-support\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Are you requesting disability-related supports for training or education?\", \"fr\": \"Demandez-vous des soutiens liés à un handicap pour une formation ou des études ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"disability-support-yes-follow\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Tell us what support you are requesting.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez le soutien que vous demandez.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Disability-related support requested\", \"fr\": \"Soutien lié à un handicap demandé\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support_yes_follow\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"has-disability\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"student-loans-and-grants\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Student Loans and Grants\", \"fr\": \"Student Loans and Grants\"}, \"stepId\": \"student-loans-and-grants\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"loan-grant\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Include Canada Student Loans or Grants, provincial student aid (e.g. AFE, OSAP), or other education funding.\", \"fr\": \"Incluez les prêts ou bourses d’études du Canada, l’aide étudiante provinciale (p. ex. AFE, OSAP) ou d’autres financements pour l’éducation.\"}, \"name\": \"loan-grant\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Do you currently receive any student financial assistance?\", \"fr\": \"Recevez-vous actuellement une aide financière étudiante ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"loan-grant-details\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Provide the program name (e.g. AFE, Canada Student Loan) and the amount you receive.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez le nom du programme (p. ex. AFE, prêt étudiant du Canada) et le montant que vous recevez.\"}, \"rows\": 5, \"type\": \"character-count\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Student Financial Assistance Details\", \"fr\": \"Détails sur l’aide financière étudiante\"}, \"required\": false, \"maxLength\": 200, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"threshold\": 75, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"loan-grant-details\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"storageKey\": \"loan-grant\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"This field is required.\", \"fr\": \"Ce champ est obligatoire.\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"household-income\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Household Income\", \"fr\": \"Household Income\"}, \"stepId\": \"household-income\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Household Income\", \"fr\": \"Revenu du ménage\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about the monthly income available in your household. This helps us understand your financial situation and assess requested supports. We may ask for documents later to confirm amounts.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez le revenu mensuel disponible dans votre ménage. Cela nous aide à comprendre votre situation financière et à évaluer les soutiens demandés. Nous pourrions demander des documents plus tard pour confirmer les montants.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"income-employment\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Employment Income\", \"fr\": \"Revenu d\'emploi\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"notEquals\", \"ref\": \"labour-force-status\", \"value\": \"unemployed\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"income-employment\"}, {\"id\": \"income-spousal\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spousal Income\", \"fr\": \"Revenu du conjoint\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"marital-status\", \"value\": \"married\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-spousal\"}, {\"id\": \"income-social-assist\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Social assistance or income assistance\", \"fr\": \"Aide sociale ou soutien du revenu\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"social-assistance\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-social-assist\"}, {\"id\": \"income-child-support\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Child Support\", \"fr\": \"Pension alimentaire pour enfants\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"dependent-children\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-child-support\"}, {\"id\": \"income-child-benefit\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Canada Child Benefit (CCB)\", \"fr\": \"Allocation canadienne pour enfants (ACE)\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"exists\", \"ref\": \"dependent-children\"}, {\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"dependent-children\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-child-benefit\"}, {\"id\": \"income-jordans\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Jordan’s Principle support\", \"fr\": \"Soutien lié au principe de Jordan\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-jordans\"}, {\"id\": \"income-band-funding\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band or Nation funding\", \"fr\": \"Financement d’une bande ou d’une Nation\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-band-funding\"}, {\"id\": \"income-alimony\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spousal support or alimony\", \"fr\": \"Pension alimentaire pour conjoint\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"marital-status\", \"value\": \"divorced\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-alimony\"}, {\"id\": \"income-other\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Name the source of the income.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez la source du revenu.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other income source (if applicable)\", \"fr\": \"Autre source de revenus (s’il y a lieu)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"text\", \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-other\"}, {\"id\": \"income-other-description\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other income amount\", \"fr\": \"Montant des autres revenus\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"income-other-description\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"household-expenses\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Household Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Household Expenses\"}, \"stepId\": \"household-expenses\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Household expenses\", \"fr\": \"Dépenses du ménage\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about your regular monthly household and training-related expenses. This helps us understand your financial situation and assess requested supports. We may ask for documents later to confirm amounts.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez vos dépenses mensuelles habituelles du ménage et liées à la formation. Cela nous aide à comprendre votre situation financière et à évaluer les soutiens demandés. Nous pourrions demander des documents plus tard pour confirmer les montants.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-rent\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Your share of monthly rent or mortgage payments for your primary residence, including mandatory housing fees. Do not include home repairs, property taxes, or insurance.\", \"fr\": \"Votre part du loyer mensuel ou des paiements hypothécaires pour votre résidence principale, y compris les frais de logement obligatoires. N’incluez pas les réparations domiciliaires, les taxes foncières ou l’assurance.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Rent/Mortgage\", \"fr\": \"Loyer/Hypothèque\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-rent\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-groceries\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Include basic food items, fresh produce, bread, dairy, meat, pantry staples, and essential household supplies— not including takeout, restaurants, or alcohol.\", \"fr\": \"Incluez les aliments de base, les produits frais, le pain, les produits laitiers, la viande, les aliments de garde-manger et les fournitures ménagères essentielles—sans inclure la restauration à emporter, les restaurants ou l’alcool.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Groceries\", \"fr\": \"Épicerie\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-groceries\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-electricity\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Monthly electricity bill from a public utility or prepaid electricity.\", \"fr\": \"Facture mensuelle d’électricité d’une entreprise de services publics ou électricité prépayée.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Electricity/Hydro\", \"fr\": \"Électricité/Hydro\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-electricity\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-heating\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Include costs such as natural gas, heating oil, propane, wood, pellets, or generator fuel when it is your main heat or power source.\", \"fr\": \"Incluez les coûts comme le gaz naturel, le mazout, le propane, le bois, les granules ou le carburant de génératrice lorsqu’il s’agit de votre principale source de chauffage ou d’énergie.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Home Heating\", \"fr\": \"Chauffage domestique\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-heating\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-water\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"E.g. municipal water charges, rural water delivery / trucked water, or community co-op or band-managed water fees charged to households.\", \"fr\": \"Par ex. frais municipaux d’eau, livraison d’eau rurale / eau livrée par camion, ou frais d’eau gérés par une coopérative communautaire ou une bande facturés aux ménages.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Water\", \"fr\": \"Eau\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-water\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-sewerage\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Municipal sewer fees, charge-per-use wastewater utilities, septic system services directly tied to occupancy, e.g. regular pump-outs if required to safely inhabit the dwelling (NOT major repairs or replacement)\", \"fr\": \"Frais municipaux d’égouts, frais à l’usage pour les services d’eaux usées, services de système septique liés directement à l’occupation, par ex. vidanges régulières si nécessaires pour habiter le logement en toute sécurité (PAS les réparations majeures ou le remplacement)\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Sewer / Wastewater\", \"fr\": \"Égout / eaux usées\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-sewerage\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-garbage\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"E.g. mandatory municipal garbage collection fees, or mandatory recycling/organics fees.\", \"fr\": \"Par ex. frais municipaux obligatoires pour la collecte des ordures, ou frais obligatoires pour le recyclage/les matières organiques.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Waste Management\", \"fr\": \"Gestion des déchets\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-garbage\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-transport\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select any transportation costs related to your training or education.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez les frais de transport liés à votre formation ou à vos études.\"}, \"name\": \"expenses-transport\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transport Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Frais de transport\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Transit pass\", \"fr\": \"Laissez-passer de transport en commun\"}, \"value\": \"buss_pass\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"expenses-bus-pass\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Monthly cost of a transit pass for school or training.\", \"fr\": \"Coût mensuel d’un laissez-passer de transport en commun pour l’école ou la formation.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Bus Pass\", \"fr\": \"Passe d\'autobus\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses_bus_pass\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Parking at school or training site\", \"fr\": \"Stationnement à l’école ou au lieu de formation\"}, \"value\": \"parking\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"expenses-parking\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Monthly parking cost at your school or training site.\", \"fr\": \"Coût mensuel du stationnement à votre école ou à votre lieu de formation.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Parking Charges\", \"fr\": \"Frais de stationnement\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-parking\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Mileage between home and school or training site\", \"fr\": \"Kilométrage entre le domicile et l’école ou le lieu de formation\"}, \"value\": \"mileage\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"expenses-transport-mileage\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Estimated kilometres travelled between home and your school or training site each month.\", \"fr\": \"Kilomètres estimatifs parcourus entre votre domicile et votre école ou lieu de formation chaque mois.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Mileage\", \"fr\": \"Kilométrage\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"km per month\", \"fr\": \"km par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses_transport_mileage\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"expenses-transport\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-other-list\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \