leted\", \"fr\": \"Année du plus haut niveau d’études terminé\"}}, {\"key\": \"education-location\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Place where highest education was completed\", \"fr\": \"Lieu où le plus haut niveau d’études a été terminé\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-8\", \"html\": {\"en\": \"<p style=\\\"background-color: #e3e6ea !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 18px !important; text-align: center !important; padding: 14px 0 !important; margin: 28px 0 14px 0 !important;\\\">Goals & Requested Supports</p>\", \"fr\": \"<p style=\\\"background-color: #e3e6ea !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 18px !important; text-align: center !important; padding: 14px 0 !important; margin: 28px 0 14px 0 !important;\\\">Objectifs et soutiens demandés</p>\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-7\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"long-term-goal\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Work or training goal\", \"fr\": \"Objectif de travail ou de formation\"}}, {\"key\": \"barriers\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Current challenges\", \"fr\": \"Défis actuels\"}}, {\"key\": \"other-barrier\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other challenge\", \"fr\": \"Autre défi\"}}, {\"key\": \"target-program\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Program or support of interest\", \"fr\": \"Programme ou soutien recherché\"}}, {\"key\": \"requested-supports\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Supports requested\", \"fr\": \"Soutiens demandés\"}}, {\"key\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Current childcare arrangement\", \"fr\": \"Situation actuelle en matière de garde d’enfants\"}}, {\"key\": \"other-requested-support\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other requested support\", \"fr\": \"Autre soutien demandé\"}}, {\"key\": \"disability-support\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Disability-related support requested\", \"fr\": \"Soutien lié à un handicap demandé\"}}, {\"key\": \"disab