de ou d’une Nation\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-alimony\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spousal support or alimony\", \"fr\": \"Pension alimentaire pour conjoint\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-other\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other income source\", \"fr\": \"Autre source de revenus\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-other-description\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other income amount\", \"fr\": \"Montant des autres revenus\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-10\", \"html\": {\"en\": \"<p style=\\\"background-color: #e3e6ea !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 18px !important; text-align: center !important; padding: 14px 0 !important; margin: 28px 0 14px 0 !important;\\\">Household Expenses</p>\", \"fr\": \"<p style=\\\"background-color: #e3e6ea !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 18px !important; text-align: center !important; padding: 14px 0 !important; margin: 28px 0 14px 0 !important;\\\">Dépenses du ménage</p>\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-9\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"expenses-rent\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Rent or mortgage\", \"fr\": \"Loyer ou hypothèque\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-groceries\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Groceries\", \"fr\": \"Épicerie\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-electricity\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Electricity or hydro\", \"fr\": \"Électricité ou hydro\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-heating\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Home heating\", \"fr\": \"Chauffage du logement\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-water\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Water\", \"fr\": \"Eau\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-sewerage\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Sewer or wastewater\", \"fr\": \"Égouts ou eaux usées\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-garbage\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Waste management\", \"fr\": \"Gestion des déchets\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-transport\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transportation costs\", \"fr\": \"Frais de transport\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses_bus_pass