Alberta\"}, \"value\": \"ab\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"British Columbia\", \"fr\": \"Colombie-Britannique\"}, \"value\": \"bc\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Manitoba\", \"fr\": \"Manitoba\"}, \"value\": \"mb\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"New Brunswick\", \"fr\": \"Nouveau-Brunswick\"}, \"value\": \"nb\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Newfoundland and Labrador\", \"fr\": \"Terre-Neuve-et-Labrador\"}, \"value\": \"nl\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Nova Scotia\", \"fr\": \"Nouvelle-Écosse\"}, \"value\": \"ns\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Northwest Territories\", \"fr\": \"Territoires du Nord-Ouest\"}, \"value\": \"nt\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Nunavut\", \"fr\": \"Nunavut\"}, \"value\": \"nu\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Ontario\", \"fr\": \"Ontario\"}, \"value\": \"on\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Prince Edward Island\", \"fr\": \"Île-du-Prince-Édouard\"}, \"value\": \"pe\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Quebec\", \"fr\": \"Québec\"}, \"value\": \"qc\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Saskatchewan\", \"fr\": \"Saskatchewan\"}, \"value\": \"sk\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yukon\", \"fr\": \"Yukon\"}, \"value\": \"yt\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"United States\", \"fr\": \"États-Unis\"}, \"value\": \"us\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other country\", \"fr\": \"Autre pays\"}, \"value\": \"14\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"storageKey\": \"education-location\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"employment-goals-and-barriers\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Employment Goals and Barriers\", \"fr\": \"Employment Goals and Barriers\"}, \"stepId\": \"employment-goals-and-barriers\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Employment and training goals\", \"fr\": \"Objectifs d’emploi et de formation\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about the work or training you want to pursue and any supports that may help you get there.\", \"fr\": \"Parlez-nous du travail ou de la formation que vous souhaitez poursuivre et des soutiens qui pourraient vous aider à y parvenir.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"long-term-goal\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about the goal you want to work toward.\", \"fr\": \"Décrivez l’objectif vers lequel vous souhaitez progresser.\"}, \"rows\": 5, \"type\": \"character-count\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What work or training goal would you like ISET to support?\", \"fr\": \"Quel objectif de travail ou de formation souhaitez-vous que le programme ISET soutienne ?\"}, \"required\": false, \"maxLength\": 500, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"threshold\": 75, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"long-term-goal\"}, {\"id\": \"barriers\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les réponses qui s’appliquent.\"}, \"name\": \"barriers\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What challenges or circumstances may affect your training or employment plans right now?\", \"fr\": \"Quels défis ou quelles circonstances peuvent avoir une incidence sur vos projets de formation ou d’emploi en ce moment ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Education or training\", \"fr\": \"Éducation ou formation\"}, \"value\": \"education\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Funding or finances\", \"fr\": \"Financement ou finances\"}, \"value\": \"funding\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Limited local job opportunities\", \"fr\": \"Possibilités d’emploi limitées dans votre région\"}, \"value\": \"lack-of-job-opportunities\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Location or transportation\", \"fr\": \"Lieu de résidence ou transport\"}, \"value\": \"location\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"other-barrier\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about another challenge or support need.\", \"fr\": \"Décrivez un autre défi ou besoin de soutien.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other challenge (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Autre défi (veuillez préciser)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"other-barrier\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"barriers\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"target-program\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Choose the option that best fits where you are right now.\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez l’option qui correspond le mieux à votre situation actuelle.\"}, \"name\": \"target-program\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What kind of program or support are you interested in right now?\", \"fr\": \"Quel type de programme ou de soutien vous intéresse en ce moment ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Formal training such as college, university, or vocational courses that help you gain new skills or credentials.\", \"fr\": \"Formation formelle telle que collège, université ou cours professionnels qui vous aident à acquérir de nouvelles compétences ou qualifications.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Skills Development (Education)\", \"fr\": \"Développement des compétences (Éducation)\"}, \"value\": \"skills_development\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Support to help an employer hire you by covering part of your wages during a training or probation period.\", \"fr\": \"Soutien pour aider un employeur à vous embaucher en couvrant une partie de votre salaire durant une période de formation ou de probation.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Targeted Wage Subsidy\", \"fr\": \"Subvention salariale ciblée\"}, \"value\": \"tws\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Short-term work experience on a community or project-based initiative that builds your employability.\", \"fr\": \"Expérience de travail à court terme dans une initiative communautaire ou basée sur un projet qui développe votre employabilité.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Job Creation Partnership\", \"fr\": \"Partenariat de création d’emplois\"}, \"value\": \"jcp\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Training delivered to a group of participants with similar learning goals, often led by an employer or community partner.\", \"fr\": \"Formation offerte à un groupe de participants ayant des objectifs d\'apprentissage similaires, souvent dirigée par un employeur ou un partenaire communautaire.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Group Training\", \"fr\": \"Formation en groupe\"}, \"value\": \"group\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Assistance to start or grow your own business, including business planning or mentorship.\", \"fr\": \"Assistance pour démarrer ou développer votre propre entreprise, incluant la planification d\'affaires ou le mentorat.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-employment supports\", \"fr\": \"Soutien au travail autonome\"}, \"value\": \"self_support\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You have not yet chosen a specific program or employer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n\'avez pas encore choisi de programme ou d\'employeur spécifique.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Not yet\", \"fr\": \"Pas encore\"}, \"value\": \"not_yet\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"target-program\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Financial Supports Requested\", \"fr\": \"Financial Supports Requested\"}, \"stepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Supports requested\", \"fr\": \"Soutiens demandés\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us which supports would help you take part in your training or employment plan.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez les soutiens qui vous aideraient à participer à votre parcours de formation ou d’emploi.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"requested-supports\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les réponses qui s’appliquent.\"}, \"name\": \"requested-supports\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Which supports are you requesting at this time?\", \"fr\": \"Quels soutiens demandez-vous en ce moment ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for course or program tuition and mandatory fees\", \"fr\": \"Coûts liés aux frais de scolarité du cours ou du programme et aux frais obligatoires\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Tuition\", \"fr\": \"Frais de scolarité\"}, \"value\": \"tuition\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for textbooks, supplies, and other required learning materials\", \"fr\": \"Coûts pour les manuels, les fournitures et autres matériels d’apprentissage obligatoires\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Books and program materials\", \"fr\": \"Livres et matériel de programme\"}, \"value\": \"books\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for housing, groceries and basic utilities\", \"fr\": \"Coûts pour le logement, les courses et les services publics de base\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Living allowance\", \"fr\": \"Allocation de subsistance\"}, \"value\": \"living\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for commuting, transit passes, fuel, or other travel related to the program\", \"fr\": \"Coûts liés aux déplacements domicile‑études, aux laissez‑passer de transport en commun, au carburant ou à tout autre déplacement lié au programme\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transportation\", \"fr\": \"Transport\"}, \"value\": \"transportation\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Costs for daycare, babysitting, or other dependent care while attending the program\", \"fr\": \"Coûts pour la garderie, le babysitting ou d’autres services de garde de personnes à charge pendant que vous suivez le programme\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Childcare\", \"fr\": \"Garde d’enfants\"}, \"value\": \"childcare\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Which options best describe your current childcare arrangement? Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Quelles options décrivent le mieux votre situation actuelle en matière de garde d’enfants ? Sélectionnez toutes les réponses qui s’appliquent.\"}, \"name\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Current childcare arrangement\", \"fr\": \"Situation actuelle en matière de garde d’enfants\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"No childcare funding received\", \"fr\": \"Aucun financement pour la garde d’enfants\"}, \"value\": \"no-funding-received\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"EI/CRF\", \"fr\": \"AE/CRF\"}, \"value\": \"ei-crf\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Provincial funding or subsidy\", \"fr\": \"Financement ou subvention provinciale\"}, \"value\": \"provincial-funding-subsidy\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"FNICCI\", \"fr\": \"FNICCI\"}, \"value\": \"fnicci\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No childcare spaces available\", \"fr\": \"Aucune place en service de garde disponible\"}, \"value\": \"daycare-not-available\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Supported by family\", \"fr\": \"Soutien de la famille\"}, \"value\": \"assisted-by-family\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-funded\", \"fr\": \"Autofinancement\"}, \"value\": \"self-funded\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"childcare-fuding-status\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}]}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Any other eligible education-related costs not listed above\", \"fr\": \"Tout autre coût admissible lié aux études qui n’est pas mentionné ci‑dessus\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"other-requested-support\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other support requested\", \"fr\": \"Autre soutien demandé\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"other-requested-support\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"requested-supports\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"disability-support\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you need disability-related supports to take part in training or education, tell us here. We may ask for medical or professional documentation later if it is needed to assess your request.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez besoin de soutiens liés à un handicap pour participer à une formation ou à des études, indiquez-le ici. Nous pourrions demander plus tard une documentation médicale ou professionnelle si elle est nécessaire pour évaluer votre demande.\"}, \"name\": \"disability-support\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Are you requesting disability-related supports for training or education?\", \"fr\": \"Demandez-vous des soutiens liés à un handicap pour une formation ou des études ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"disability-support-yes-follow\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Tell us what support you are requesting.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez le soutien que vous demandez.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Disability-related support requested\", \"fr\": \"Soutien lié à un handicap demandé\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support_yes_follow\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"has-disability\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"student-loans-and-grants\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Student Loans and Grants\", \"fr\": \"Student Loans and Grants\"}, \"stepId\": \"student-loans-and-grants\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"loan-grant\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Include Canada Student Loans or Grants, provincial student aid (e.g. AFE, OSAP), or other education funding.\", \"fr\": \"Incluez les prêts ou bourses d’études du Canada, l’aide étudiante provinciale (p. ex. AFE, OSAP) ou d’autres financements pour l’éducation.\"}, \"name\": \"loan-grant\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Do you currently receive any student financial assistance?\", \"fr\": \"Recevez-vous actuellement une aide financière étudiante ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"loan-grant-details\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Provide the program name (e.g. AFE, Canada Student Loan) and the amount you receive.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez le nom du programme (p. ex. AFE, prêt étudiant du Canada) et le montant que vous recevez.\"}, \"rows\": 5, \"type\": \"character-count\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Student Financial Assistance Details\", \"fr\": \"Détails sur l’aide financière étudiante\"}, \"required\": false, \"maxLength\": 200, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"threshold\": 75, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"loan-grant-details\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"storageKey\": \"loan-grant\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"This field is required.\", \"fr\": \"Ce champ est obligatoire.\"}}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"household-income\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Household Income\", \"fr\": \"Household Income\"}, \"stepId\": \"household-income\", \"components\": 