ance\", \"fr\": \"Aide sociale ou soutien du revenu\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-child-support\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Child support\", \"fr\": \"Pension alimentaire pour enfants\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-child-benefit\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Canada Child Benefit (CCB)\", \"fr\": \"Allocation canadienne pour enfants (ACE)\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-jordans\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Jordan’s Principle support\", \"fr\": \"Soutien lié au principe de Jordan\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-band-funding\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band or Nation funding\", \"fr\": \"Financement d’une bande ou d’une Nation\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-alimony\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spousal support or alimony\", \"fr\": \"Pension alimentaire pour conjoint\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-other\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other income source\", \"fr\": \"Autre source de revenus\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-other-description\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other income amount\", \"fr\": \"Montant des autres revenus\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-10\", \"html\": {\"en\": \"<p style=\\\"background-color: #e3e6ea !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 18px !important; text-align: center !important; padding: 14px 0 !important; margin: 28px 0 14px 0 !important;\\\">Household Expenses</p>\", \"fr\": \"<p style=\\\"background-color: #e3e6ea !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 18px !important; text-align: center !important; padding: 14px 0 !important; margin: 28px 0 14px 0 !important;\\\">Dépenses du ménage</p>\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-9\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"expenses-rent\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Rent or mortgage\", \"fr\": \"Loyer ou hypothèque\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-groceries\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Groceries\", \"fr\": \"Épicerie\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-electricity\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Electricity or hydro\", \"fr\": \"Électricité ou hydro\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-heating\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Home heating\", \"fr\": \"Chauffage du logement\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-water\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Water\", \"fr\": \"Eau\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-sewerage\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Sewer or wastewater\", \"fr\": \"Égouts ou eaux usées\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-garbage\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Waste management\", \"fr\": \"Gestion des déchets\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-transport\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transportation costs\", \"fr\": \"Frais de transport\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses_bus_pass\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transit pass\", \"fr\": \"Laissez-passer de transport en commun\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-parking\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Parking\", \"fr\": \"Stationnement\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses_transport_mileage\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Mileage\", \"fr\": \"Kilométrage\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-other-list\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Additional training-related expenses\", \"fr\": \"Dépenses supplémentaires liées à la formation\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-other-total\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other expenses total\", \"fr\": \"Total des autres dépenses\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}], \"nextStepId\": \"iset-document-upload\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"ISET Document Upload\", \"fr\": \"ISET Document Upload\"}, \"stepId\": \"iset-document-upload\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Documents to upload\", \"fr\": \"Documents à téléverser\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Based on your answers, please upload any documents that apply to your application. You can upload scans or clear photos from your phone.\", \"fr\": \"Selon vos réponses, veuillez téléverser tous les documents qui s’appliquent à votre demande. Vous pouvez téléverser des numérisations ou des photos claires prises avec votre téléphone.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"govt-id\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Upload a clear image of a government-issued photo ID, such as a driver’s licence, provincial or territorial ID card, or passport. If information appears on both sides, upload clear images of the front and back.\", \"fr\": \"Téléversez une image claire d’une pièce d’identité avec photo délivrée par le gouvernement, comme un permis de conduire, une carte d’identité provinciale ou territoriale, ou un passeport. Si des renseignements figurent au recto et au verso, téléversez des images claires des deux côtés.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Government-issued photo ID\", \"fr\": \"Pièce d’identité avec photo délivrée par le gouvernement\"}, \"accept\": \"image/*\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"govt-id\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the front and back of your ID\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser le recto et le verso de votre pièce d’identité\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"identity_document\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Government ID\"}, {\"id\": \"status-card\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you have a status, treaty, citizenship, or enrolment card, upload clear images of each side or of each page needed to confirm eligibility.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez une carte de statut, de traité, de citoyenneté ou d’inscription, téléversez des images claires de chaque côté ou de chaque page nécessaires pour confirmer votre admissibilité.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Status, treaty, citizenship, or enrolment card\", \"fr\": \"Carte de statut, de traité, de citoyenneté ou d’inscription\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"has_reg_number\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"status-card\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the front and back of your status card\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser le recto et le verso de votre carte de statut\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"status_card\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Status Card\"}, {\"id\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you cannot provide a status, citizenship, or enrolment card or number, upload your reference letter or letters from Indigenous leadership confirming your connection to community.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous ne pouvez pas fournir de carte ou de numéro de statut, de citoyenneté ou d’inscription, téléversez votre ou vos lettres de référence provenant d’un leadership autochtone confirmant votre lien avec votre communauté.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Letters of Reference\", \"fr\": \"Lettres de référence\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 6, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"notEquals\", \"ref\": \"has_reg_number\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference\", \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"and\": [{\"if\": [{\"var\": \"status-card.length\"}, {\"<\": [{\"var\": \"status-card.length\"}, 1]}, {\"!\": {\"var\": \"status-card.filePath\"}}]}, {\"if\": [{\"var\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference.length\"}, {\"<\": [{\"var\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference.length\"}, 1]}, {\"!\": {\"var\": \"uploaded-letters-of-reference.filePath\"}}]}]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"Please upload two reference letters\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser deux lettres de référence\"}, \"trigger\": [\"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": false}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"letter_of_reference\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Letters of reference\"}, {\"id\": \"acceptance-letter\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you already have an acceptance letter or another document confirming your participation in a training program, employer placement, or project, upload it here.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déjà une lettre d’acceptation ou un autre document confirmant votre participation à un programme de formation, à un placement chez un employeur ou à un projet, téléversez-le ici.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Letter of Acceptance\", \"fr\": \"Lettre d\'acceptation\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"notEquals\", \"ref\": \"target-program\", \"value\": \"self_support\"}, {\"op\": \"notEquals\", \"ref\": \"target-program\", \"value\": \"not_yet\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"acceptance-letter\", \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule_target_program_mandatory\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"and\": [{\"in\": [{\"var\": \"target-program\"}, [\"skills_development\", \"tws\", \"jcp\", \"group\"]]}, {\"if\": [{\"var\": \"acceptance-letter.length\"}, {\"<\": [{\"var\": \"acceptance-letter.length\"}, 1]}, {\"!\": {\"var\": \"acceptance-letter.filePath\"}}]}]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"Please upload something confirming your acceptance\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser un document confirmant votre acceptation\"}, \"trigger\": [\"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": false}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"acceptance_letter\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Letter o