ast 3 months.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser les relevés de paie du conjoint ou de la conjointe pour les 3 derniers mois.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Spousal Pay Stubs\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-social-assistance\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you reported social assistance or income assistance, please upload a recent statement or benefit letter.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déclaré de l’aide sociale ou un soutien du revenu, veuillez téléverser un relevé ou une lettre de prestations récente.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Social Assistance Statement or Benefit Letter\", \"fr\": \"Relevé d\'aide sociale ou lettre de prestation\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-social-assist\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-social-assistance\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload a recent Social Assistance Statement or Benefit Letter\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez télécharger un relevé d\'aide sociale ou une lettre de prestations récents.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Social Assistance Statement or Benefit Letter\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-child-support\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you reported child support, please upload a recent court order, agreement, or payment statement.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déclaré une pension alimentaire pour enfants, veuillez téléverser une ordonnance, une entente ou un relevé de paiement récent.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Child Support Order or Payment Statement\", \"fr\": \"Ordonnance de pension alimentaire pour enfants ou relevé de paiement\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-child-support\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-child-support\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload a recent Child Support Order or Payment Statement\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez télécharger une ordonnance ou un relevé de paiement de pension alimentaire pour enfants récent.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Child Support Order or Payment Statement\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-ccb-statement\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you reported Canada Child Benefit, please upload a recent Canada Child Benefit statement or notice.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déclaré l’Allocation canadienne pour enfants, veuillez téléverser un relevé ou un avis récent de l’Allocation canadienne pour enfants.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Canada Child Benefit (CCB) statement\", \"fr\": \"Relevé de l’Allocation canadienne pour enfants (ACE)\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-child-benefit\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-ccb-statement\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload a recent Canada Child Benefit (CCB) statement.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser un relevé récent de l’Allocation canadienne pour enfants (ACE).\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Canada Child Benefit (CCB) Statement\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-jordans\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you reported Jordan’s Principle support, please upload the approval or confirmation document.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déclaré un soutien lié au principe de Jordan, veuillez téléverser le document d’approbation ou de confirmation.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Jordan’s Principle Funding Confirmation\", \"fr\": \"Confirmation du financement du principe de Jordan\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-jordans\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-jordans\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload your Jordan’s Principle support confirmation.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser votre confirmation de soutien lié au principe de Jordan.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Jordan’s Principle Funding Confirmation\"}, {\"id\": \"upload-spousal-alimony\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you reported spousal support or alimony, please upload the court order, agreement, or other confirmation document.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déclaré une pension alimentaire pour conjoint, veuillez téléverser l’ordonnance, l’entente ou un autre document de confirmation.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spousal Support Agreement or Court Order\", \"fr\": \"Accord ou ordonnance judiciaire de pension alimentaire pour conjoint\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-alimony\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-spousal-alimony\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload your Spousal Support Agreement or Court Order\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser votre convention de pension alimentaire ou votre ordonnance du tribunal.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_income\", \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Spousal Support Agreement or Court Order\"}, {\"id\": \"band-denial-letter\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you are not receiving band or Nation funding for this plan, please upload the denial letter or other written confirmation you received.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous ne recevez pas de financement d’une bande ou d’une Nation pour ce projet, veuillez téléverser la lettre de refus ou toute autre confirmation écrite reçue.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band or Nation funding denial letter\", \"fr\": \"Lettre de refus de financement d’une bande ou d’une Nation\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"emptyOrZero\", \"ref\": \"income-band-funding\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"band-denial-letter\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the funding denial letter or other written confirmation.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser la lettre de refus de financement ou une autre confirmation écrite.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"band_funding_decision\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Band Denial Letter\"}, {\"id\": \"student-financial-assistance-statement\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Upload a document that shows your current student funding (e.g. loan or grant statement, funding summary, or award letter).\", \"fr\": \"Téléchargez un document qui montre votre financement étudiant actuel (par exemple, relevé de prêt ou de subvention, résumé de financement ou lettre d\'attribution).\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Student financial assistance statement\", \"fr\": \"Déclaration d\'aide financière aux étudiants\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"loan-grant\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"student_financial_assistance_statement\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload your student financial assistance statement\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser votre relevé d’aide financière aux études\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": false, \"documentType\": \"student_financial_assistance_statement\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Student Financial Assistance Statement\"}, {\"id\": \"band-funding-letter\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you are receiving band or Nation funding for this plan, please upload the approval or confirmation letter.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous recevez un financement d’une bande ou d’une Nation pour ce projet, veuillez téléverser la lettre d’approbation ou de confirmation.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band or Nation funding confirmation letter\", \"fr\": \"Lettre confirmant le financement d’une bande ou d’une Nation\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-band-funding\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"band-funding-letter\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload the funding approval or confirmation letter.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser la lettre d’approbation ou de confirmation du financement.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": false, \"documentType\": \"band_funding_decision\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Band Funding Letter\"}, {\"id\": \"medical-documents\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you are requesting disability-related support, please upload any medical or professional documentation that explains the support you need. If you are requesting specialized equipment over $650, please also upload supplier quotes.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous demandez un soutien lié à un handicap, veuillez téléverser toute documentation médicale ou professionnelle expliquant le soutien dont vous avez besoin. Si vous demandez de l’équipement spécialisé de plus de 650 $, veuillez aussi téléverser les devis des fournisseurs.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Medical or professional documentation\", \"fr\": \"Documentation médicale ou professionnelle\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"exists\", \"ref\": \"disability-support_yes_follow\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"medical-documents\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload supporting documentation.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser des documents justificatifs.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": false, \"documentType\": \"medical_documentation\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Medical Documentation\"}, {\"id\": \"lease-mortgage-statement\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you reported rent or mortgage costs, please upload a lease, rent agreement, mortgage statement, or similar document.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déclaré des frais de loyer ou d’hypothèque, veuillez téléverser un bail, une entente de location, un relevé hypothécaire ou un document semblable.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Lease, rent agreement, or mortgage statement\", \"fr\": \"Bail, entente de location ou relevé hypothécaire\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"expenses-rent\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"lease-mortgage-statement\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload your rent agreement or mortgage statement\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser votre bail ou votre relevé hypothécaire\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"evidence_expense\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Mortgage or Rental \"}, {\"id\": \"upload-utilities\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you reported electricity or hydro costs, please upload bills or statements from the last 3 months.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déclaré des frais d’électricité ou d’hydro, veuillez téléverser les factures ou relevés des 3 derniers mois.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Utility bills from the last 3 months\", \"fr\": \"Factures de services publics des 3 derniers mois\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 15, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"expenses-electricity\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"upload-utilities\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload utility bills from the last 3 months.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser les factures de services publics des 3 derniers mois.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": false, \"documentType\": \"evidence_expense\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Utility Bill\"}, {\"id\": \"uploaded-resume\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Please attach a recent résumé (CV).\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez joindre un curriculum vitæ (CV) récent.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Resume / CV\", \"fr\": \"Curriculum vitæ\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.doc,.docx,.rtf,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": true, \"maxSizeMb\": 5, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"uploaded-resume\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please upload a current resume or CV.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez téléverser un curriculum vitæ à jour.\"}}, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"resume\", \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Resume / CV\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"legal-and-submission\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Legal and Submission\", \"fr\": \"Legal and Submission\"}, \"stepId\": \"legal-and-submission\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Review and submit\", \"fr\": \"Vérifier et soumettre\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"You are ready to submit your application. Please review the statements below and sign to confirm that the information you provided is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. After you submit, NWAC will receive your application and you will receive a confirmation email with next steps. You can sign back into your dashboard to check your status and contact your worker if needed.\", \"fr\": \"Votre demande est prête à être soumise. Veuillez lire les déclarations ci-dessous et signer pour confirmer que les renseignements fournis sont complets et exacts à votre connaissance. Après la soumission, l’AFAC recevra votre demande et vous recevrez un courriel de confirmation indiquant les prochaines étapes. Vous pourrez vous reconnecter à votre tableau de bord pour vérifier l’état de votre dossier et communiquer avec votre intervenant(e) au besoin.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-hint\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"By signing below, you confirm that the Native Women’s Association of Canada (NWAC) and its ISET delivery partners may collect and use the personal and sensitive information needed to assess your request for ISET funding. This includes your Social Insurance Number (SIN), which is used only to confirm eligibility for ISET supports such as skills training or wage subsidies funded by Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC).\", \"fr\": \"En signant ci-dessous, vous confirmez que l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada (AFAC) et ses partenaires de prestation du programme ISET peuvent recueillir et utiliser les renseignements personnels et sensibles nécessaires pour évaluer votre demande de financement dans le cadre d’ISET. Cela comprend votre numéro d’assurance sociale (NAS), qui est utilisé uniquement pour confirmer votre admissibilité à des soutiens ISET, comme la formation professionnelle ou les subventions salariales financées par Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC).\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Your information is collected and managed under the Privacy Act (R.S.C. 1985, c. P-21), the Department of Employment and Social Development Act (S.C. 2005, c. 34), and the Access to Information Act (R.S.C. 1985, c. A-1). It is used to assess eligibility, administer ISET services, measure program results, evaluate the program, and meet reporting obligations.\", \"fr\": \"Vos renseignements sont recueillis et gérés en vertu de la Loi sur la protection des renseignements personnels (L.R.C. 1985, ch. P-21), de la Loi sur le ministère de l’Emploi et du Développement social (L.C. 2005, ch. 34) et de la Loi sur l’accès à l’information (L.R.C. 1985, ch. A-1). Ils servent à évaluer l’admissibilité, à administrer les services ISET, à mesurer les résultats du programme, à en évaluer l’efficacité et à répondre aux exigences de reddition de comptes.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-5\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"NWAC and its ISET delivery partners will treat this information as confidential and use reasonable safeguards to protect it from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure.\", \"fr\": \"L’AFAC et ses partenaires de prestation du programme ISET traiteront ces renseignements de façon confidentielle et prendront des mesures de protection raisonnables pour prévenir tout accès, usage ou divulgation non autorisés.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-6\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Your personal information will not be used or shared for other purposes unless you consent or the law requires it. It will be kept only as long as necessary for these purposes.\", \"fr\": \"Vos renseignements personnels ne seront pas utilisés ni communiqués à d’autres fins, sauf avec votre consentement ou si la loi l’exige. Ils seront conservés seulement pendant la durée nécessaire à ces fins.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-7\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training (ISET) program helps increase Indigenous participation in the Canadian labour market and supports access to meaningful, sustainable employment. The program provides training and employment supports to Indigenous women in all their gender diversity in Canada, including First Nations applicants with or without status, Inuit applicants, and Métis applicants living on reserve, off reserve, in urban centres, or in rural or remote communities.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que le programme de formation et d’emploi des compétences des Autochtones (ISET) contribue à accroître la participation des Autochtones au marché du travail canadien et à soutenir l’accès à un emploi significatif et durable. Le programme offre des soutiens à la formation et à l’emploi aux femmes autochtones dans toute leur diversité de genre au Canada, y compris aux membres des Premières Nations avec ou sans statut, aux Inuit et aux Métis vivant dans une réserve, hors réserve, dans un centre urbain ou dans une communauté rurale ou éloignée.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-8\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that NWAC may review my eligibility if information about my Indigenous identity is incomplete, false, or misleading. If a review confirms that I was not eligible, funding may be paused or ended, any funding agreement may be cancelled, and ineligible funds may need to be repaid to ESDC.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que l’AFAC peut revoir mon admissibilité si les renseignements fournis au sujet de mon identité autochtone sont incomplets, faux ou trompeurs. Si une vérification confirme que je n’étais pas admissible, le financement peut être suspendu ou prendre fin, toute entente de financement peut être annulée et les fonds non admissibles peuvent devoir être remboursés à EDSC.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-9\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"For this program, I declare that I identify as an Indigenous person in Canada, meaning First Nations, Inuit, or Métis.\", \"fr\": \"Pour ce programme, je déclare que je m’identifie comme une personne autochtone au Canada, c’est-à-dire membre des Premières Nations, Inuit ou Métis.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"legal-submission-sig\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Type your full legal name and select Sign.\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom légal complet, puis sélectionnez Signer.\"}, \"type\": \"signature-ack\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom complet pour signer\"}, \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"legal_submission_sig\", \"actionLabel\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}, \"placeholder\": {\"en\": \"First name Last name\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom de famille\"}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}], \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}], \"templates\": {\"counts\": {}, \"metaMap\": {}}}}','2026-03-24 10:55:55'),(65,'events_capture','application_submission.application_started','{\"enabled\": true, \"updated_at\": \"2025-11-04T15:26:02.313Z\", \"updated_by\": \"7cad7598-d0d1-708d-0d42-d2abfe7dd933\"}','2025-11-04 10:26:02'),(67,'runtime','intake.ephemeral_ttl_minutes','{\"minutes\": 5}','2025-11-04 11:37:22'),(68,'runtime','intake.session_timeout_warning_seconds','{\"seconds\": 30}','2025-11-04 12:02:57'),(69,'admin','auth.config','{\"admin\": {\"policy\": {\"lockout\": {\"threshold\": 5, \"durationSeconds\": 900}, \"mfaMode\": \"optional\", \"federation\": {\"lastSync\": null, \"providers\": []}, \"pkceRequired\": true, \"passwordPolicy\": {\"minLength\": 12, \"requireLower\": true, \"requireUpper\": true, \"requireNumber\": true, \"requireSymbol\": false}, \"anomalyProtection\": \"standard\", \"maxPasswordResetsPerDay\": 5}, \"tokenTtl\": {\"id\": 3600, \"access\": 3600, \"refresh\": 86400, \"absolute\": 28800, \"frontendIdle\": 300, \"warningTriggerSeconds\": 870, \"warningCountdownSeconds\": 30}}, \"public\": {\"policy\": {\"lockout\": {\"threshold\": 5, \"durationSeconds\": 900}, \"mfaMode\": \"optional\", \"federation\": {\"lastSync\": null, \"providers\": []}, \"pkceRequired\": true, \"passwordPolicy\": {\"minLength\": 12, \"requireLower\": true, \"requireUpper\": true, \"requireNumber\": true, \"requireSymbol\": false}, \"anomalyProtection\": \"standard\", \"maxPasswordResetsPerDay\": 5}, \"tokenTtl\": {\"id\": 3600, \"access\": 3600, \"refresh\": 86400, \"absolute\": 28800, \"frontendIdle\": 6030, \"warningSeconds\": 30, \"warningTriggerSeconds\": 6000, \"warningCountdownSeconds\": 30}}}','2026-02-04 10:00:40'),(111,'events_capture','notes.reminder_created','{\"enabled\": true, \"updated_at\": \"2025-11-16T22:28:24.125Z\", \"updated_by\": \"7cad7598-d0d1-708d-0d42-d2abfe7dd933\"}','2025-11-16 17:28:24'),(113,'events_capture','notes.note_added','{\"enabled\": true, \"updated_at\": \"2025-11-16T22:28:26.650Z\", \"updated_by\": \"7cad7598-d0d1-708d-0d42-d2abfe7dd933\"}','2025-11-16 17:28:26'),(115,'admin','backend.jobs','{\"reminderPollMinutes\": 1}','2025-11-17 18:51:24'),(129,'workflow','autoAssignment','{\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1771246251216\", \"label\": \"Ontario and Quebec\", \"assignee\": \"emarion@nwac.ca\", \"priority\": 5, \"assigneeId\": \"336511\", \"conditions\": [{\"id\": \"cond-1771246218190-0.47467697082397486\", \"op\": \"in\", \"field\": \"province\", \"value\": [\"on\", \"qc\"]}]}], \"enabled\": false}','2026-02-20 09:18:44'),(138,'checklist','checklist.compliance.iset','{\"id\": \"iset-compliance-v1\", \"gates\": [{\"id\": \"submit_application\", \"items\": [{\"id\": \"identity-document\", \"label\": \"Identity document\", \"notes\": \"Front and back, but a single image of both is OK.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"identity_document\"]}, {\"id\": \"indigenous-declaration\", \"label\": \"Indigenous declaration\", \"notes\": \"Auto-generated when the application is submitted.\", \"sources\": [\"application_form\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"indigenous_declaration\"]}, {\"id\": \"letter-of-reference\", \"label\": \"Letter of Reference\", \"notes\": \"Alternative to the status/treaty card. If used, two letters of reference are required.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": false, \"documentTypes\": [\"letter_of_reference\"]}, {\"id\": \"resume\", \"label\": \"Resume\", \"notes\": \"One per client, but must be kept up to date.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"resume\"]}, {\"id\": \"status-or-treaty-card\", \"label\": \"Status or Treaty Card\", \"notes\": \"Either the status/treaty card (front and back) OR two letters of reference are required.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": false, \"documentTypes\": [\"status_card\"]}, {\"id\": \"band-or-nation-funding-decision-letter\", \"label\": \"Band or Nation funding Decision letter\", \"notes\": \"Either a funding approval or denial letter is required.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"band_funding_confirmation\", \"band_funding_denial\", \"band_funding_decision\"]}, {\"id\": \"conflict-of-interest-form\", \"label\": \"Conflict of Interest Form\", \"notes\": \"Auto-generated when the application is submitted.\", \"sources\": [\"application_form\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"conflict_of_interest\"]}, {\"id\": \"letter-of-acceptance\", \"label\": \"Letter of Acceptance\", \"notes\": \"Required for applications other than \'Self-employment Support\'.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"acceptance_letter\"]}, {\"id\": \"medical-documentation\", \"label\": \"Medical documentation\", \"notes\": \"Required only if the client is requesting funding related to disability support.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"medical_documentation\"]}, {\"id\": \"evidence-of-income\", \"label\": \"Evidence of Income\", \"notes\": \"Pay slips, support statements - anything listed as income.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"evidence_income\"]}, {\"id\": \"evidence-of-expense\", \"label\": \"Evidence of Expense\", \"notes\": \"Utility bills, rental agreements, mortgage statements - anything listed under household expenses that reasonably has documentary evidence.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"evidence_expense\"]}, {\"id\": \"student_financial_assistance_statement\", \"label\": \"Student financial assistance statement\", \"notes\": \"Upload a document that shows your current student funding (e.g. loan or grant statement, funding summary, or award letter).\", \"sources\": [\"application_form\", \"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\", \"system_generated\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"student_financial_assistance_statement\"]}], \"label\": \"Gate 1 - Submit Application\", \"statuses\": [\"submitted\", \"in_review\", \"docs_requested\", \"closure_notice\", \"pending_approval\"], \"statusScope\": \"application\"}, {\"id\": \"start_assessment\", \"items\": [{\"id\": \"ei-consent-form\", \"label\": \"EI Consent Form\", \"notes\": \"EI assessment is completed first (after the conflict-of-interest check; once staff unlock the assessment form).\", \"sources\": [\"application_form\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"ei_consent\"]}, {\"id\": \"ei-eligibility-verification\", \"label\": \"EI Eligibility Verification\", \"notes\": \"EI assessment is completed first (after the conflict-of-interest check; once staff unlock the assessment form).\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"ei_verification\"]}, {\"id\": \"case-manager-assessment\", \"label\": \"Case manager assessment\", \"notes\": \"Auto-generated PDF of the completed assessment.\", \"sources\": [\"application_form\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"case_assessment\"]}], \"label\": \"Gate 2 - Start Assessment\", \"statuses\": [\"submitted\", \"in_review\", \"docs_requested\", \"closure_notice\", \"pending_approval\"], \"statusScope\": \"application\"}, {\"id\": \"submit_assessment\", \"items\": [{\"id\": \"evidence-of-expense-submit-assessment\", \"label\": \"Evidence of Expense (lease/mortgage statement; 3 months of utility bills, childcare, etc.)\", \"notes\": \"Checked during assessment to ensure there were no omissions.\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"evidence_expense\"]}, {\"id\": \"evidence-of-income-submit-assessment\", \"label\": \"Evidence of Income (paystubs; CTB statement; ROE, T4s, etc.)\", \"notes\": \"What is mandatory depends on what was declared in the application (e.g., spousal income).\", \"sources\": [\"application_submission\", \"manual_upload\", \"secure_message_attachment\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"evidence_income\"]}, {\"id\": \"application-form\", \"label\": \"Application form\", \"notes\": \"Auto-generated PDF when the assessment is submitted (includes any corrections).\", \"sources\": [\"application_form\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"application_form\"]}], \"label\": \"Gate 3 - Submit Assessment\", \"statuses\": [\"submitted\", \"in_review\", \"docs_requested\", \"closure_notice\", \"pending_approval\"], \"statusScope\": \"application\"}, {\"id\": \"deny\", \"items\": [], \"label\": \"Gate 4 - Deny\", \"statuses\": [\"closure_notice\"], \"statusScope\": \"application\"}, {\"id\": \"approve\", \"items\": [{\"id\": \"financial-overview\", \"label\": \"Financial Overview\", \"notes\": \"System generated from the application form\", \"sources\": [\"system_generated\"], \"required\": true, \"documentTypes\": [\"financial_overview\"]}], \"label\": \"Gate 5 - Approve\", \"statuses\": [\"pending_approval\", \"decision_ready\"], \"statusScope\": \"application\"}, {\"id\": \"approve_and_commence\", \"items\": [{\"id\": \"client-funding-agreement\", \"label\": \"Client Funding Agreement\", \"notes\": \"Fuinding agreement signed by the app