nt made directly to a vendor or institution for required books, supplies, or learning materials.\", \"submissionTiming\": \"intervention_start\"}, {\"code\": \"BooksMaterialsReimbursement\", \"label\": \"Books and materials (reimbursement)\", \"notes\": \"Reimbursement to the participant for required books or learning materials they have purchased.\", \"submissionTiming\": \"intervention_end\"}, {\"code\": \"JCPProjectCost\", \"label\": \"JCP project cost\", \"notes\": \"Eligible costs associated with a Job Creation Partnership or similar project-based intervention, typically paid to an employer or project sponsor.\", \"submissionTiming\": \"manual_trigger\"}, {\"code\": \"SEBSupport\", \"label\": \"SEB support\", \"notes\": \"Financial support provided under a Self-Employment Benefit intervention to assist participants while establishing or operating an approved business activity.\", \"submissionTiming\": \"recurrence_schedule\"}, {\"code\": \"OtherEligibleCost\", \"label\": \"Other eligible cost\", \"notes\": \"An eligible cost not otherwise categorized, supported by justification and evidence in accordance with program requirements.\", \"submissionTiming\": \"manual_trigger\"}, {\"code\": \"StudentLoanRepayment\", \"label\": \"Student Loan Repayment\", \"notes\": \"USed when NWAC has agreed to repay the particpant student load or equivalent in part or in its entirity.\", \"submissionTiming\": \"intervention_end\"}], \"interventions\": [{\"code\": \"1\", \"name\": \"Career research & exploration\", \"defaultOnAssessment\": true, \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"Transportation\", \"OtherEligibleCost\", \"Childcare\"]}, {\"code\": \"2\", \"name\": \"Diagnostic assessment\", \"defaultOnAssessment\": false, \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"Transportation\", \"OtherEligibleCost\", \"Childcare\"]}, {\"code\": \"3\", \"name\": \"Employment counselling\", \"defaultOnAssessment\": false, \"availablePaymentTypes\": [\"Transportation\", \"Childcare\", \"OtherEligibleCost\"]}, {\"c