 {\"en\": \"3\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-select\", \"disabled\": false, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-10-07 12:20:32','2025-10-07 12:20:32'),(1563,122,4,13,'{\"id\": \"example-date\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"For example, 27 3 2007\", \"fr\": \"Par exemple, 27 3 2007\"}}, \"name\": \"example-date\", \"items\": [{\"name\": \"day\", \"classes\": \"govuk-input--width-2\"}, {\"name\": \"month\", \"classes\": \"govuk-input--width-2\"}, {\"name\": \"year\", \"classes\": \"govuk-input--width-4\"}], \"classes\": \"\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"4\", \"fr\": \"Entrez la date\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"autocompletePreset\": \"\"}','2025-10-07 12:20:32','2025-10-07 12:20:32'),(1580,114,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Apply for your Passport\", \"fr\": \"Demandez votre passeport\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-10-07 13:46:05','2025-10-07 13:46:05'),(1581,114,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This workflow demonstrates how the intake editor can be used to create custom forms.\", \"fr\": \"Ce flux de travail montre comment l\'éditeur d\'entrée peut être utilisé pour créer des formulaires personnalisés.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-10-07 13:46:05','2025-10-07 13:46:05'),(1582,117,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"Yes\", \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": \"No\", \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Have you had a Canada passport before?\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-07 13:53:53','2025-10-07 13:53:53'),(1584,123,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You can pay extra for an appointment at a passport office if you need it urgently\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": \"\\tUsually within 3 weeks - it will be delivered securely to your home. £94.50 (or £107.50 for a 54-page frequent traveller passport)\", \"text\": \"Standard\", \"value\": \"1\"}, {\"hint\": \"Delivered by courier to your home 1 week after the appointment.  £178 (or £191 for a 54-page frequent traveller passport)\", \"text\": \"1 week Fast Track\", \"value\": \"2\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect it 4 hours after your appointment. £222 (or £235 for a 54-page frequent traveller passport) \", \"text\": \"1-day Premium\", \"value\": \"3\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Do you need a passport urgently?\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-07 13:59:20','2025-10-07 13:59:20'),(1587,102,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"The Nine Walkers, also called the Fellowship of the Ring, were chosen in Rivendell to counter the Nine Riders of Sauron and to bear the One Ring toward its destruction in Mordor. They were a company of diverse peoples, representing the Free Peoples of Middle-earth: Frodo Baggins the Ring-bearer, Samwise Gamgee his loyal companion, Merry Brandybuck and Pippin Took his cousins, Gandalf the wizard, Aragorn the ranger and heir of Isildur, Legolas the elf, Gimli the dwarf, and Boromir of Gondor. Their task was not to fight armies but to support Frodo’s perilous journey into the heart of enemy territory. The Fellowship embodied unity across races long divided, but as their path grew darker, their bonds were tested, and the company ultimately fractured, setting each member on different but interconnected courses in the War of the Ring.\", \"fr\": \"Les Neuf Compagnons, également appelés la Fraternité de l\'Anneau, ont été choisis à Rivendell pour contrer les Neuf Cavaliers de Sauron et porter l\'Anneau vers sa destruction à Mordor. Ils étaient une compagnie de divers peuples, représentant les Libres Peuples de Terre du Milieu : Frodo Baggins, le porteur de l\'Anneau, Samwise Gamgee son compagnon fidèle, Merry Brandybuck et Peregrin Took ses cousins, Gandalf le magicien, Aragorn le ranger et héritier d\'Isildur, Legolas l\'elfe, Gimli l\'nain, et Boromir de Gondor. Leur tâche n\'était pas de combattre des armées mais de soutenir le voyage périlleux de Frodo vers le cœur du territoire ennemi. La Fraternité incarnait l\'unité across races long divisées, mais comme leur chemin s\'est rendu plus sombre, leurs liens ont été mis à l\'épreuve, et la compagnie a finalement été divisée, faisant chacun membre partir sur des chemins différents mais interconnectés dans la Guerre du Cercle.\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Frodo Baggins\", \"fr\": \"Frodo Baggins\"}, \"value\": \"frodo\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Samwise Gamgee\", \"fr\": \"Samwise Gamgee\"}, \"value\": \"sam\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Meriadoc Brandybuck\", \"fr\": \"Meriadoc Brandybuck\"}, \"value\": \"merry\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Peregrin Took\", \"fr\": \"Peregrin Took\"}, \"value\": \"pippin\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Gandalf\", \"fr\": \"Gandalf\"}, \"value\": \"gandalf\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Aragorn\", \"fr\": \"Aragorn\"}, \"value\": \"aragorn\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Legolas Greenleaf\", \"fr\": \"Legolas Greenleaf\"}, \"value\": \"legolas\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Gimli\", \"fr\": \"Gimli\"}, \"value\": \"gimli\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Boromir\", \"fr\": \"Boromir\"}, \"value\": \"boromir\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Chose a member of the fellowship\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez un membre de la fraternité\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-08 13:45:55','2025-10-08 13:45:55'),(1588,102,2,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You can only choose one\", \"fr\": \"Vous ne pouvez en choisir qu’un\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio-2\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Elven refuge in the Misty Mountains\", \"fr\": \"Refuge elfique dans les Monts Brumeux\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Rivendell\", \"fr\": \"Fondcombe\"}, \"value\": \"rivendell\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Land of the Dark Lord Sauron\", \"fr\": \"Terre du Seigneur des Ténèbres Sauron\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Mordor\", \"fr\": \"Mordor\"}, \"value\": \"mordor\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Hobbit homeland in the northwest of Middle-earth\", \"fr\": \"Patrie des Hobbits dans le nord-ouest de la Terre du Milieu\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"The Shire\", \"fr\": \"La Comté\"}, \"value\": \"shire\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Land of the horse-lords\", \"fr\": \"Terre des seigneurs des chevaux\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Rohan\", \"fr\": \"Rohan\"}, \"value\": \"rohan\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Kingdom of Men near Mordor\", \"fr\": \"Royaume des Hommes près de Mordor\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Gondor\", \"fr\": \"Gondor\"}, \"value\": \"gondor\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Choose an option\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez une option\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-08 13:45:55','2025-10-08 13:45:55'),(1605,124,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Please select one of the following options to proceed. You will have an opportunity to add family or group members and request additional service options later in the booking process. Hover over the item for a description of the service.\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": \"Submit new or renewal passport applications\", \"text\": \"Passport Application\", \"value\": \"passport_application\", \"conditionalChildId\": \"example-input\"}, {\"hint\": \"Submit visa applications for various countries\", \"text\": \"Visa Application Submission\", \"value\": \"visa_application_submission\"}, {\"hint\": \"Fingerprint and photograph collection\", \"text\": \"Biometric Collection\", \"value\": \"biometric_collection\"}, {\"hint\": \"Verification of application documents\", \"text\": \"Document Verification\", \"value\": \"document_verification\"}, {\"hint\": \"Book appointments for visa interviews\", \"text\": \"Interview Scheduling\", \"value\": \"interview_scheduling\"}, {\"hint\": \"Check status of submitted applications\", \"text\": \"Application Status Tracking\", \"value\": \"application_status_tracking\"}, {\"hint\": \"Receive passports after processing\", \"text\": \"Passport Delivery\", \"value\": \"passport_delivery\"}, {\"hint\": \"On-site photograph for applications\", \"text\": \"Photo Capture\", \"value\": \"photo_capture\"}, {\"hint\": \"Help with completing application forms\", \"text\": \"Form Filling Assistance\", \"value\": \"form_filling_assistance\"}, {\"hint\": \"Make payments for application fees\", \"text\": \"Payment Processing\", \"value\": \"payment_processing\"}, {\"hint\": \"Guidance about visa and passport procedures\", \"text\": \"Information Counselling\", \"value\": \"information_counselling\"}, {\"hint\": \"Schedule visits to the centre\", \"text\": \"Appointment Booking\", \"value\": \"appointment_booking\"}, {\"hint\": \"Return of original documents after verification\", \"text\": \"Document Return Service\", \"value\": \"document_return_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Issue of emergency travel documents\", \"text\": \"Emergency Passport Service\", \"value\": \"emergency_passport_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Translation of documents if required\", \"text\": \"Translation Services\", \"value\": \"translation_services\"}, {\"hint\": \"Notarizing documents for official use\", \"text\": \"Notarization Services\", \"value\": \"notarization_services\"}, {\"hint\": \"Assistance and queries handling\", \"text\": \"Customer Support\", \"value\": \"customer_support\"}, {\"hint\": \"Medical checks required for some visa types\", \"text\": \"Health Screening\", \"value\": \"health_screening\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect vaccination records relevant to visa\", \"text\": \"Vaccination Collection\", \"value\": \"vaccination_collection\"}, {\"hint\": \"Courier delivery of documents and passports\", \"text\": \"Courier Service\", \"value\": \"courier_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Assistance with data entry for applications\", \"text\": \"Data Entry Service\", \"value\": \"data_entry_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Confirm applicant identity through documents\", \"text\": \"Identity Verification\", \"value\": \"identity_verification\"}, {\"hint\": \"Legal advice related to visa applications\", \"text\": \"Legal Advisory\", \"value\": \"legal_advisory\"}, {\"hint\": \"Digitizing application documents\", \"text\": \"Document Scanning\", \"value\": \"document_scanning\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect applicant fingerprints\", \"text\": \"Fingerprint Capture\", \"value\": \"fingerprint_capture\"}, {\"hint\": \"Capture iris biometric data\", \"text\": \"Iris Scan\", \"value\": \"iris_scan\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect voice biometric data\", \"text\": \"Voice Recognition\", \"value\": \"voice_recognition\"}, {\"hint\": \"Conduct background verification\", \"text\": \"Background Check Service\", \"value\": \"background_check_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Reminders for scheduled appointments\", \"text\": \"Appointment Reminder Service\", \"value\": \"appointment_reminder_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Faster processing of applications\", \"text\": \"Express Service\", \"value\": \"express_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Support for group visa applications\", \"text\": \"Group Application Service\", \"value\": \"group_application_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Specialized support for student visas\", \"text\": \"Student Visa Service\", \"value\": \"student_visa_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Assistance with work permit applications\", \"text\": \"Work Permit Service\", \"value\": \"work_permit_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Advice on immigration options\", \"text\": \"Immigration Consultation\", \"value\": \"immigration_consultation\"}, {\"hint\": \"Certification of documents\", \"text\": \"Document Authentication\", \"value\": \"document_authentication\"}, {\"hint\": \"Information and purchase of travel insurance\", \"text\": \"Travel Insurance Service\", \"value\": \"travel_insurance_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Certified translations for official use\", \"text\": \"Translation Certification\", \"value\": \"translation_certification\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Which service do you require\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-16 14:01:09','2025-10-16 14:01:09'),(1606,124,2,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter the requested value.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"example-input\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Please enter your passport number\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-10-16 14:01:09','2025-10-16 14:01:09'),(1627,78,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Eligibility Check\", \"fr\": \"Vérification d\'admissibilité\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1628,78,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Please answer the following questions to determine your eligibility for the ISET program.\", \"fr\": \"Répondez aux questions suivantes pour déterminer votre éligibilité au programme ISET.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body-l\"}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1629,78,3,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"This program is for Indigenous Peoples: First Nations, Inuit, or Métis.\", \"fr\": \"Ce programme est destiné aux Peuples autochtones : First Nations, Inuit ou Métis.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-indigenous\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Are you a member of a First Nations, Inuit, or Métis group?\", \"fr\": \"Êtes-vous un membre d\'un groupe First Nations, Inuit ou Métis ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"eligibility-indigenous-required\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-indigenous\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1630,78,4,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"ISET is open to Indigenous women in their diversities.\", \"fr\": \"ISET est ouvert aux femmes autochtones dans leurs diversités.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-female\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Do you identify as a woman?\", \"fr\": \"Vous identifiez-vous comme une femme ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1756933101438-0dxf\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-female\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1631,78,5,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-3\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You must be a Canadian citizen to qualify for ISET funding.\", \"fr\": \"Vous devez être une citoyenne canadienne pour être éligible au financement ISET.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-canadian\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Are you a Canadian citizen?\", \"fr\": \"Êtes-vous une citoyenne canadienne ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087157281-7u8s\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-canadian\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1632,78,6,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-5\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You may qualify if you are not working, working less than you want, or at risk of losing your job.\", \"fr\": \"Vous pourriez être éligible si vous n\'avez pas de travail, si vous travaillez moins qu\'il vous faut ou si vous risquez de perdre votre emploi.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-employment\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Are you unemployed, under-employed, or at risk of unemployment?\", \"fr\": \"Êtes-vous sans emploi, sous-employé(e) ou à risque de chômage ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087215312-7enu\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-employment\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1633,78,7,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-6\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"This includes college, university, or other recognized training programs that help you get a job.\", \"fr\": \"Cela comprend les collèges, les universités ou d\'autres programmes de formation reconnus qui vous aident à trouver un emploi.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-training\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Are you pursuing or planning to pursue post-secondary training leading to employment?\", \"fr\": \"Suivez-vous ou planifiez-vous des études postsecondaires conduisant à un emploi ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087227077-5qno\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-training\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1634,78,8,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-7\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"ISET funding is for applicants whose education or training costs are not fully paid by other sources (e.g., Band, student loans).\", \"fr\": \"Le financement ISET est destiné aux demandeurs dont les frais d\'éducation ou de formation n\'ont pas tous été payés par d\'autres sources (par exemple, par la bande ou par des prêts étudiants).\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-financial\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Do you have a financial need not fully covered by other funding?\", \"fr\": \"Avez-vous une nécessité financière non couverte par d\'autres financements ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087241712-unb6\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-financial\"}, \"no\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1635,78,9,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-8\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"If you have previously lost ISET funding due to default or other disqualification, you may not be eligible.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez déjà perdu le financement ISET à cause de défaut ou d\'autres raisons d\'exclusion, vous pourriez ne pas être éligible.\"}}, \"name\": \"eligibility-disqualified\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Have you ever been disqualified from ISET funding due to default or other reasons?\", \"fr\": \"Avez-vous déjà été exclu(e) du financement ISET à cause de défaut ou d\'autres raisons ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [{\"id\": \"rule-1757087254780-h1kc\", \"type\": \"predicate\", \"when\": {\"==\": [{\"var\": \"eligibility-disqualified\"}, \"yes\"]}, \"block\": true, \"message\": {\"en\": \"You are not eligible to apply based on this answer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas admissible à présenter une demande selon cette réponse.\"}, \"trigger\": [\"change\", \"submit\"], \"severity\": \"error\"}], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"A response is required\", \"fr\": \"Une réponse est requise\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:06:57','2025-11-05 09:06:57'),(1656,82,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Gender information\", \"fr\": \"Renseignements sur le genre\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\", \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select an option for what is your gender identity?\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez une option pour what is your gender identity?\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Select an option for what is your gender identity?\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez une option pour what is your gender identity?\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:41:42','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(1657,82,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"These questions help us understand who the program is reaching. ISET supports Indigenous women in all their gender diversity.\", \"fr\": \"Ces questions nous aident à comprendre qui le programme rejoint. ISET soutient les femmes autochtones dans toute leur diversité de genre.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-05 09:41:42','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(1658,82,3,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Use the sex recorded at birth, if you know it.\", \"fr\": \"Utilisez le sexe inscrit à la naissance, si vous le connaissez.\"}}, \"name\": \"biological_sex\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": \"\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Female\", \"fr\": \"Femme\"}, \"value\": \"female\"}, {\"hint\": \"\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Male\", \"fr\": \"Homme\"}, \"value\": \"male\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"What sex were you assigned at birth?\", \"fr\": \"Quel sexe vous a-t-on assigné à la naissance ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select the sex you were assigned at birth.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner le sexe qui vous a été assigné à la naissance.\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select the sex you were assigned at birth.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner le sexe qui vous a été assigné à la naissance.\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:41:42','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(1659,82,4,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Select the gender identity that best fits you now.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez l’identité de genre qui vous correspond le mieux actuellement.\"}}, \"name\": \"gender_identity\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Woman\", \"fr\": \"Femme\"}, \"value\": \"female\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Man\", \"fr\": \"Homme\"}, \"value\": \"male\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Another identity\", \"fr\": \"Une autre identité\"}, \"value\": \"other\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-radios--inline\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Which gender identity best describes you?\", \"fr\": \"Quelle identité de genre vous correspond le mieux ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select your gender identity.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner votre identité de genre.\"}}}','2025-11-05 09:41:42','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(1937,93,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Employment and training goals\", \"fr\": \"Objectifs d’emploi et de formation\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-11-05 13:14:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(1938,93,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about the work or training you want to pursue and any supports that may help you get there.\", \"fr\": \"Parlez-nous du travail ou de la formation que vous souhaitez poursuivre et des soutiens qui pourraient vous aider à y parvenir.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body-l\"}','2025-11-05 13:14:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(1939,93,3,31,'{\"id\": \"example-character-count\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about the goal you want to work toward.\", \"fr\": \"Décrivez l’objectif vers lequel vous souhaitez progresser.\"}}, \"name\": \"long-term-goal\", \"rows\": 5, \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"What work or training goal would you like ISET to support?\", \"fr\": \"Quel objectif de travail ou de formation souhaitez-vous que le programme ISET soutienne ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"\", \"maxwords\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"maxlength\": 500, \"threshold\": 75, \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-11-05 13:14:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(1940,93,4,33,'{\"id\": \"example-checkboxes\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les réponses qui s’appliquent.\"}}, \"name\": \"barriers\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Education or training\", \"fr\": \"Éducation ou formation\"}, \"value\": \"education\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Funding or finances\", \"fr\": \"Financement ou finances\"}, \"value\": \"funding\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Limited local job opportunities\", \"fr\": \"Possibilités d’emploi limitées dans votre région\"}, \"value\": \"lack-of-job-opportunities\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Location or transportation\", \"fr\": \"Lieu de résidence ou transport\"}, \"value\": \"location\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"conditionalChildId\": \"other-barrier\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"What challenges or circumstances may affect your training or employment plans right now?\", \"fr\": \"Quels défis ou quelles circonstances peuvent avoir une incidence sur vos projets de formation ou d’emploi en ce moment ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-11-05 13:14:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(1941,93,5,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us about another challenge or support need.\", \"fr\": \"Décrivez un autre défi ou besoin de soutien.\"}}, \"name\": \"other-barrier\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Other challenge (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Autre défi (veuillez préciser)\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-11-05 13:14:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(1942,93,6,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Choose the option that best fits where you are right now.\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez l’option qui correspond le mieux à votre situation actuelle.\"}}, \"name\": \"target-program\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Formal training such as college, university, or vocational courses that help you gain new skills or credentials.\", \"fr\": \"Formation formelle telle que collège, université ou cours professionnels qui vous aident à acquérir de nouvelles compétences ou qualifications.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Skills Development (Education)\", \"fr\": \"Développement des compétences (Éducation)\"}, \"value\": \"skills_development\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Support to help an employer hire you by covering part of your wages during a training or probation period.\", \"fr\": \"Soutien pour aider un employeur à vous embaucher en couvrant une partie de votre salaire durant une période de formation ou de probation.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Targeted Wage Subsidy\", \"fr\": \"Subvention salariale ciblée\"}, \"value\": \"tws\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Short-term work experience on a community or project-based initiative that builds your employability.\", \"fr\": \"Expérience de travail à court terme dans une initiative communautaire ou basée sur un projet qui développe votre employabilité.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Job Creation Partnership\", \"fr\": \"Partenariat de création d’emplois\"}, \"value\": \"jcp\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Training delivered to a group of participants with similar learning goals, often led by an employer or community partner.\", \"fr\": \"Formation offerte à un groupe de participants ayant des objectifs d\'apprentissage similaires, souvent dirigée par un employeur ou un partenaire communautaire.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Group Training\", \"fr\": \"Formation en groupe\"}, \"value\": \"group\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Assistance to start or grow your own business, including business planning or mentorship.\", \"fr\": \"Assistance pour démarrer ou développer votre propre entreprise, incluant la planification d\'affaires ou le mentorat.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Self-employment supports\", \"fr\": \"Soutien au travail autonome\"}, \"value\": \"self_support\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You have not yet chosen a specific program or employer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n\'avez pas encore choisi de programme ou d\'employeur spécifique.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Not yet\", \"fr\": \"Pas encore\"}, \"value\": \"not_yet\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"What kind of program or support are you interested in right now?\", \"fr\": \"Quel type de programme ou de soutien vous intéresse en ce moment ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-11-05 13:14:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2044,121,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Review and submit\", \"fr\": \"Vérifier et soumettre\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2045,121,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"You are ready to submit your application. Please review the statements below and sign to confirm that the information you provided is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. After you submit, NWAC will receive your application and you will receive a confirmation email with next steps. You can sign back into your dashboard to check your status and contact your worker if needed.\", \"fr\": \"Votre demande est prête à être soumise. Veuillez lire les déclarations ci-dessous et signer pour confirmer que les renseignements fournis sont complets et exacts à votre connaissance. Après la soumission, l’AFAC recevra votre demande et vous recevrez un courriel de confirmation indiquant les prochaines étapes. Vous pourrez vous reconnecter à votre tableau de bord pour vérifier l’état de votre dossier et communiquer avec votre intervenant(e) au besoin.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-hint\"}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2046,121,3,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-3\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"By signing below, you confirm that the Native Women’s Association of Canada (NWAC) and its ISET delivery partners may collect and use the personal and sensitive information needed to assess your request for ISET funding. This includes your Social Insurance Number (SIN), which is used only to confirm eligibility for ISET supports such as skills training or wage subsidies funded by Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC).\", \"fr\": \"En signant ci-dessous, vous confirmez que l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada (AFAC) et ses partenaires de prestation du programme ISET peuvent recueillir et utiliser les renseignements personnels et sensibles nécessaires pour évaluer votre demande de financement dans le cadre d’ISET. Cela comprend votre numéro d’assurance sociale (NAS), qui est utilisé uniquement pour confirmer votre admissibilité à des soutiens ISET, comme la formation professionnelle ou les subventions salariales financées par Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC).\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2047,121,4,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-4\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Your information is collected and managed under the Privacy Act (R.S.C. 1985, c. P-21), the Department of Employment and Social Development Act (S.C. 2005, c. 34), and the Access to Information Act (R.S.C. 1985, c. A-1). It is used to assess eligibility, administer ISET services, measure program results, evaluate the program, and meet reporting obligations.\", \"fr\": \"Vos renseignements sont recueillis et gérés en vertu de la Loi sur la protection des renseignements personnels (L.R.C. 1985, ch. P-21), de la Loi sur le ministère de l’Emploi et du Développement social (L.C. 2005, ch. 34) et de la Loi sur l’accès à l’information (L.R.C. 1985, ch. A-1). Ils servent à évaluer l’admissibilité, à administrer les services ISET, à mesurer les résultats du programme, à en évaluer l’efficacité et à répondre aux exigences de reddition de comptes.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2048,121,5,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-5\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-5\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"NWAC and its ISET delivery partners will treat this information as confidential and use reasonable safeguards to protect it from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure.\", \"fr\": \"L’AFAC et ses partenaires de prestation du programme ISET traiteront ces renseignements de façon confidentielle et prendront des mesures de protection raisonnables pour prévenir tout accès, usage ou divulgation non autorisés.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2049,121,6,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-6\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-6\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Your personal information will not be used or shared for other purposes unless you consent or the law requires it. It will be kept only as long as necessary for these purposes.\", \"fr\": \"Vos renseignements personnels ne seront pas utilisés ni communiqués à d’autres fins, sauf avec votre consentement ou si la loi l’exige. Ils seront conservés seulement pendant la durée nécessaire à ces fins.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2050,121,7,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-7\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-7\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training (ISET) program helps increase Indigenous participation in the Canadian labour market and supports access to meaningful, sustainable employment. The program provides training and employment supports to Indigenous women in all their gender diversity in Canada, including First Nations applicants with or without status, Inuit applicants, and Métis applicants living on reserve, off reserve, in urban centres, or in rural or remote communities.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que le programme de formation et d’emploi des compétences des Autochtones (ISET) contribue à accroître la participation des Autochtones au marché du travail canadien et à soutenir l’accès à un emploi significatif et durable. Le programme offre des soutiens à la formation et à l’emploi aux femmes autochtones dans toute leur diversité de genre au Canada, y compris aux membres des Premières Nations avec ou sans statut, aux Inuit et aux Métis vivant dans une réserve, hors réserve, dans un centre urbain ou dans une communauté rurale ou éloignée.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2051,121,8,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-8\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-8\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that NWAC may review my eligibility if information about my Indigenous identity is incomplete, false, or misleading. If a review confirms that I was not eligible, funding may be paused or ended, any funding agreement may be cancelled, and ineligible funds may need to be repaid to ESDC.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que l’AFAC peut revoir mon admissibilité si les renseignements fournis au sujet de mon identité autochtone sont incomplets, faux ou trompeurs. Si une vérification confirme que je n’étais pas admissible, le financement peut être suspendu ou prendre fin, toute entente de financement peut être annulée et les fonds non admissibles peuvent devoir être remboursés à EDSC.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2052,121,9,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-9\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-9\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"For this program, I declare that I identify as an Indigenous person in Canada, meaning First Nations, Inuit, or Métis.\", \"fr\": \"Pour ce programme, je déclare que je m’identifie comme une personne autochtone au Canada, c’est-à-dire membre des Premières Nations, Inuit ou Métis.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2053,121,10,35,'{\"id\": \"applicant_signature\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Type your full legal name and select Sign.\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom légal complet, puis sélectionnez Signer.\"}}, \"name\": \"legal_submission_sig\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom complet pour signer\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"required\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}}, \"actionLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}}, \"placeholder\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First name Last name\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom de famille\"}}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}}','2025-11-14 09:09:36','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2100,76,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"How we use your information\", \"fr\": \"Comment nous utilisons vos renseignements\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-11-18 19:19:21','2026-03-16 13:09:27'),(2101,76,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"By signing below, you give the Native Women’s Association of Canada (NWAC) and its ISET partners permission to collect and use the information we need to review your application and decide what support you may be eligible for. This includes your Social Insurance Number (SIN), which we use to confirm your eligibility.\", \"fr\": \"En signant ci-dessous, vous donnez à l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada (AFAC) et à ses partenaires ISET la permission de recueillir et d’utiliser les renseignements dont nous avons besoin pour examiner votre demande et déterminer à quels soutiens vous pourriez être admissible. Cela comprend votre numéro d’assurance sociale (NAS), que nous utilisons pour confirmer votre admissibilité.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-18 19:19:21','2026-03-16 13:09:27'),(2102,76,3,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-3\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"We ask only for the information needed to process your application, provide ISET services, understand program results, and report on how the program is working.\", \"fr\": \"Nous demandons seulement les renseignements nécessaires pour traiter votre demande, offrir les services ISET, comprendre les résultats du programme et rendre compte de son fonctionnement.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-18 19:19:21','2026-03-16 13:09:27'),(2103,76,4,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-4\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"We will keep your information confidential and protect it with reasonable security measures.\", \"fr\": \"Nous garderons vos renseignements confidentiels et les protégerons au moyen de mesures de sécurité raisonnables.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-18 19:19:21','2026-03-16 13:09:27'),(2104,76,5,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-5\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-5\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"We will not use or share your personal information for other reasons unless you agree or we are required to by law. We will keep it only as long as it is needed for your application and the program.\", \"fr\": \"Nous n’utiliserons ni ne communiquerons vos renseignements personnels pour d’autres raisons sans votre accord, sauf si la loi nous y oblige. Nous les conserverons seulement pendant la période nécessaire pour votre demande et le programme.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-18 19:19:21','2026-03-16 13:09:27'),(2105,76,6,35,'{\"id\": \"applicant_signature\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"I have read how my information will be used and I agree to continue with my application.\", \"fr\": \"J’ai lu comment mes renseignements seront utilisés et j’accepte de poursuivre ma demande.\"}}, \"name\": \"consent\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign this consent\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom complet pour signer ce consentement\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"required\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}}, \"actionLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Sign now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}}, \"placeholder\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First name Last name\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom de famille\"}}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Unsigned\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}}','2025-11-18 19:19:21','2026-03-16 13:09:27'),(2266,84,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Emergency Contact\", \"fr\": \"Personne à contacter en cas d\'urgence\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-11-19 14:46:55','2025-11-19 14:46:55'),(2267,84,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Share the name of someone we can contact if there is an emergency or if we cannot reach you. This can be a family member, friend, partner, or another person you trust.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez le nom d’une personne que nous pouvons contacter en cas d’urgence ou si nous ne pouvons pas vous joindre. Il peut s’agir d’un membre de votre famille, d’un ami, d’un partenaire ou d’une autre personne de confiance.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body-l\"}','2025-11-19 14:46:55','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2268,84,3,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"name\": \"emergency-contact-name\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Emergency Contact Name\", \"fr\": \"Nom de la personne à contacter en cas d\'urgence\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter the name of your emergency contact.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez indiquer le nom de la personne à contacter en cas d’urgence.\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter the name of your emergency contact.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez indiquer le nom de la personne à contacter en cas d’urgence.\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-11-19 14:46:55','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2269,84,4,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Include area code (e.g., 613-555-9876).\", \"fr\": \"Inclure l\'indicatif régional (ex., 613-555-9876).\"}}, \"mask\": \"phone-na\", \"name\": \"emergency-contact-telephone\", \"type\": \"tel\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Emergency Contact Phone Number\", \"fr\": \"Numéro de téléphone de la personne à contacter en cas d\'urgence\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"tel\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter your emergency contact’s phone number.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez indiquer le numéro de téléphone de la personne à contacter en cas d’urgence.\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter your emergency contact’s phone number.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez indiquer le numéro de téléphone de la personne à contacter en cas d’urgence.\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-11-19 14:46:55','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2270,84,5,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-3\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"For example: parent, sibling, friend, partner, or support worker.\", \"fr\": \"Par exemple : parent, frère ou sœur, ami(e), partenaire ou personne de soutien.\"}}, \"name\": \"emergency-contact-relationship\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Relationship to You\", \"fr\": \"Lien avec vous\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us how this person knows you.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez préciser le lien de cette personne avec vous.\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us how this person knows you.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez préciser le lien de cette personne avec vous.\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-11-19 14:46:55','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2271,85,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Select the option that best matches your legal status, citizenship, or enrolment for program eligibility.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez l’option qui correspond le mieux à votre statut, à votre citoyenneté ou à votre inscription pour l’admissibilité au programme.\"}}, \"name\": \"legal-indigenous-identity\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"First Nations (Status)\", \"fr\": \"Premières Nations (avec statut)\"}, \"value\": \"first_nations_status\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First Nations (Non-Status)\", \"fr\": \"Premières Nations (sans statut)\"}, \"value\": \"first_nations_non_status\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Inuit\", \"fr\": \"Inuit\"}, \"value\": \"inuit\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Métis\", \"fr\": \"Métis\"}, \"value\": \"metis\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Which Indigenous identity category best describes you for this program?\", \"fr\": \"Quelle catégorie d’identité autochtone vous décrit le mieux pour ce programme ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"errorMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select the Indigenous identity category that best describes you.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner la catégorie d’identité autochtone qui vous décrit le mieux.\"}, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please select the Indigenous identity category that best describes you.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner la catégorie d’identité autochtone qui vous décrit le mieux.\"}}}','2025-11-19 14:47:27','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2274,127,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us whether you currently receive Employment Insurance (EI) benefits or expect to rely on EI funding for this application.\", \"fr\": \"Dites-nous si vous recevez actuellement des prestations d’assurance-emploi (AE) ou si vous prévoyez dépendre du financement AE pour cette demande.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-11-19 14:56:04','2025-11-19 14:56:04'),(2275,127,2,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Your answer helps us decide whether your application should be processed under the EI funding stream. Select the option that matches your current situation—even if you are only planning to apply for EI—so we can request the right documents and guide you through the correct process.\", \"fr\": \"Votre réponse nous aide à décider si votre demande doit être traitée dans le cadre du financement AE. Sélectionnez l’option qui correspond à votre situation actuelle, même si vous prévoyez seulement de faire une demande d’AE, afin que nous puissions demander les bons documents et vous guider dans le bon processus.\"}}, \"name\": \"ei_status\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You are already getting EI payments each month.\", \"fr\": \"Vous recevez déjà des paiements d’AE chaque mois.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Currently receiving EI\", \"fr\": \"Reçoit actuellement l’AE\"}, \"value\": \"receiving\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You are not on EI and do not plan to use it for this application.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas sur l’AE et ne prévoyez pas l’utiliser pour cette demande.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Not using EI\", \"fr\": \"N’utilise pas l’AE\"}, \"value\": \"not_receiving\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You expect to apply for EI so it can help pay for this training.\", \"fr\": \"Vous prévoyez faire une demande d’AE pour aider à financer cette formation.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Plan to apply for EI\", \"fr\": \"Prévoyez de faire une demande d’AE\"}, \"value\": \"planning\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You’re not sure if EI applies; a case manager can guide you.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n’êtes pas sûr(e) si l’AE s’applique; un intervenant peut vous guider.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Unsure about EI\", \"fr\": \"Incertain au sujet de l’AE\"}, \"value\": \"unsure\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"What best describes your Employment Insurance status\", \"fr\": \"Quelle description correspond le mieux à votre statut d’assurance-emploi\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-11-19 14:56:04','2025-11-19 14:56:04'),(2366,128,1,19,'{\"id\": \"uploaded-file\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First test is of Document Lable for a single upload.\", \"fr\": \"Le premier test concerne l\'étiquette du document pour un téléchargement unique.\"}}, \"name\": \"test-uploading-label\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"This is my test upload\", \"fr\": \"Ceci est mon téléchargement de test\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"classes\": \"\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"showMaxSize\": false, \"documentType\": \"identity_document\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"showMimeList\": false, \"documentLabel\": \"Government ID\"}','2025-11-25 11:40:24','2025-11-25 11:40:24'),(2769,87,1,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"If you would like, tell us the First Nation, Inuit, or Métis community you consider home.\", \"fr\": \"Si vous le souhaitez, indiquez la Première Nation, la communauté inuit ou la communauté métisse que vous considérez comme votre communauté d’origine.\"}}, \"name\": \"home-comminuty\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"What is your home community?\", \"fr\": \"Quelle est votre communauté d’origine ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--l\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"{indigenous-affiliation-declaration}\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-04 08:55:08','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(2863,130,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"name\": \"childcare-requested\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"Yes\", \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": \"No\", \"value\": \"no\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Is a childcare subsidy being requested?\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-12-07 08:26:17','2025-12-07 08:26:17'),(2864,130,2,33,'{\"id\": \"example-checkboxes\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les options applicables.\"}}, \"name\": \"example-checkboxes\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"Option A\", \"value\": \"a\"}, {\"text\": \"Option B\", \"value\": \"b\"}, {\"text\": \"Option C\", \"value\": \"c\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Are you currently reciev\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-12-07 08:26:17','2025-12-07 08:26:17'),(2991,134,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Choose the type of direct payment you want to set up. Your selection will determine which banking details we ask for next.\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez le type de paiement direct que vous souhaitez mettre en place. Votre sélection déterminera quels renseignements bancaires nous vous demanderons ensuite.\"}}, \"name\": \"eft-or-wire\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Standard direct deposit to a Canadian bank account.\", \"fr\": \"Dépôt direct standard dans un compte bancaire canadien.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Electronic Funds Transfer (EFT)\", \"fr\": \"Virement électronique de fonds (EFT)\"}, \"value\": \"eft\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Used only if your banking institution requires a wire transfer or if your account is outside Canada.\", \"fr\": \"À utiliser seulement si votre institution financière exige un virement bancaire ou si votre compte est à l\'extérieur du Canada.\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Wire Transfer\", \"fr\": \"Virement bancaire\"}, \"value\": \"wire-transfer\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"How Would You Like to Receive Your Payment?\", \"fr\": \"Comment souhaitez-vous recevoir votre paiement?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please chose one\"}}}','2025-12-10 12:58:46','2025-12-10 12:58:46'),(3036,137,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Authorization Agreement\", \"fr\": \"Exemple de texte\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-m\"}','2025-12-10 13:20:38','2025-12-10 13:20:38'),(3037,137,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I hereby authorize Native Women’s Association of Canada to initiate deposits to my account at the financial institution indicated on this form.\", \"fr\": \"Exemple de texte\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 13:20:38','2025-12-10 13:20:38'),(3038,137,3,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-3\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Further, I agree not to hold Native Women’s Association of Canada responsible for any delay or loss of funds due to incorrect or incomplete information supplied by me or by my financial institution or due to an error on the part of my financial institution in depositing funds to my account.\", \"fr\": \"Exemple de texte\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 13:20:38','2025-12-10 13:20:38'),(3039,137,4,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-4\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This agreement will remain in effect until Native Women’s Association of Canada receives a written notice of cancellation from me or my financial institution, or until I submit a new EFT /Wire payment deposit form to the Finance Department.\", \"fr\": \"Exemple de texte\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 13:20:38','2025-12-10 13:20:38'),(3040,137,5,35,'{\"id\": \"legal_submission_sig\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full legal name then press Sign.\"}}, \"name\": \"eft_wire_signature\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"required\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Clear\"}}, \"actionLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\"}}, \"placeholder\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First Last\"}}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Signed\"}}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:20:38','2025-12-10 13:20:38'),(3042,133,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This form collects the information needed to set up direct payments with the Native Women’s Association of Canada. You’ll be asked for your vendor details and your banking information so deposits can be made securely. It should take only a few minutes to complete, and you can upload a void cheque or bank confirmation at the end.\", \"fr\": \"Ce formulaire recueille les renseignements nécessaires pour configurer les paiements directs avec l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada. On vous demandera vos renseignements de fournisseur ainsi que vos informations bancaires afin que les dépôts puissent être effectués de façon sécuritaire. Le formulaire ne devrait prendre que quelques minutes à remplir, et vous pourrez téléverser un chèque annulé ou une confirmation bancaire à la fin.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 13:48:08','2025-12-10 13:48:08'),(3043,133,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-3\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Vendor / Payee Information\", \"fr\": \"Renseignements sur le fournisseur / bénéficiaire\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-m\"}','2025-12-10 13:48:08','2025-12-10 13:48:08'),(3044,133,3,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-4\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This first step identifies who the payment should be issued to. The details you provide must match the information your financial institution has on file.\", \"fr\": \"Cette première étape permet d’indiquer à qui le paiement doit être versé. Les renseignements fournis doivent correspondre à ceux que votre institution financière a dans ses dossiers.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 13:48:08','2025-12-10 13:48:08'),(3045,133,4,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter you name exactly as it appears on your bank statements.\", \"fr\": \"Inscrivez votre nom exactement tel qu’il apparaît sur vos relevés bancaires.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"vender-payee-name\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Vendor / Payee Name\", \"fr\": \"Nom du fournisseur / bénéficiaire\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"text\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter your name.\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"name\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:48:08','2025-12-10 13:48:08'),(3046,133,5,32,'{\"id\": \"example-textarea\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full  home address as shown on your bank statements.\", \"fr\": \"Inscrivez votre adresse complète telle qu’elle apparaît sur vos relevés bancaires.\"}}, \"name\": \"vender-address\", \"rows\": 5, \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Vendor Address\", \"fr\": \"Adresse du fournisseur\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-textarea\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"spellcheck\": false, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter your address.\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:48:08','2025-12-10 13:48:08'),(3047,133,6,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Only needed if someone other than the payee handles correspondence\", \"fr\": \"À indiquer seulement si une personne autre que le bénéficiaire s’occupe de la correspondance.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"eft-contact-person\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Contact Person (optional)\", \"fr\": \"Personne-ressource (facultatif)\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:48:08','2025-12-10 13:48:08'),(3048,133,7,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-3\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Provide a number we can reach if we have questions.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez un numéro où nous pourrons vous joindre si nous avons des questions.\"}}, \"mask\": \"phone-na\", \"name\": \"eft-phone-number\", \"type\": \"tel\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Telephone Number\", \"fr\": \"Numéro de téléphone\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"tel\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter a phone number\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"tel\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:48:08','2025-12-10 13:48:08'),(3049,133,8,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-4\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"We’ll use this for confirmations or follow-up if needed\", \"fr\": \"Nous l’utiliserons pour les confirmations ou les suivis au besoin.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"eft-email\", \"type\": \"email\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Email Address:\", \"fr\": \"Adresse courriel\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"email\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter a valid email address\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"email\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:48:08','2025-12-10 13:48:08'),(3056,139,1,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter the name of the reviewer\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"eft-ap-reviewed\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"AP Reviewed\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:56:35','2025-12-10 13:56:35'),(3057,139,2,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"SIN no is must for independent contractors or self-employed individuals rendering services to NWAC.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"eft-sin\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"SIN number\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:56:35','2025-12-10 13:56:35'),(3058,139,3,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-3\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"eft-cprs\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"CPRS / 1099\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:56:35','2025-12-10 13:56:35'),(3059,139,4,32,'{\"id\": \"example-textarea\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"N\'incluez pas d\'informations personnelles ou financières.\"}}, \"name\": \"eft-datearea\", \"rows\": 10, \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Date Stamp - Received\", \"fr\": \"Champ multi-lignes\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-textarea\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"spellcheck\": false, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-10 13:56:35','2025-12-10 13:56:35'),(3060,131,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I, the undersigned, hereby give my expressed and informed consent to the Native Women’s Association of Canada (hereinafter referred to as NWAC), and/or its sub-agreement holders to the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training Program (hereinafter referred to as ISET), permission to use my images (still or moving) and/or my spoken words in perpetuity for educational, promotional and marketing purposes with prior advance notice.\", \"fr\": \"Je, soussigné(e), consens par la présente, de manière expresse et éclairée, à accorder à l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada (Native Women’s Association of Canada, ci-après « NWAC ») et/ou à ses détenteurs de sous-ententes dans le cadre du Programme de formation et d’emploi pour les Autochtones (Indigenous Skills and Employment Training Program, ci-après « ISET »), la permission d’utiliser mon image (fixe ou animée) et/ou ma voix, à perpétuité, à des fins éducatives, promotionnelles et de marketing, sous réserve d’un préavis.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 17:48:02','2025-12-10 17:48:02'),(3061,131,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-3\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"By signing this Consent, I agree:\", \"fr\": \"En signant le présent consentement, j’accepte :\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 17:48:02','2025-12-10 17:48:02'),(3062,131,3,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-4\", \"html\": {\"en\": \"<ul>\\n  <li>To allow the recording of your image and voice (e.g., photographs, audio, or video).</li>\\n  <li>To distribute your image or recording in any medium, be it print or electronic form, which may include the Internet, including but not limited to, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, Twitter, Threads).</li>\\n  <li>To grant permission to other entities to reproduce the images or recording for educational, promotional or marketing purposes for the ISET program.</li>\\n  <li>That there is no reimbursement for the right to take, or to use your photograph or video or recording.</li>\\n</ul>\", \"fr\": \"<ul>\\n  <li>D’autoriser l’enregistrement de mon image et de ma voix (p. ex. photographies, audio ou vidéo).</li>\\n  <li>De permettre la diffusion de mon image ou de mon enregistrement sur tout support, qu’il soit imprimé ou électronique, ce qui peut inclure Internet, y compris, sans s’y limiter, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, Twitter, Threads).</li>\\n  <li>D’accorder à d’autres entités la permission de reproduire les images ou les enregistrements à des fins éducatives, promotionnelles ou de marketing pour le programme ISET.</li>\\n  <li>Qu’il n’y aura aucune rémunération pour le droit de prendre ou d’utiliser ma photographie, ma vidéo ou mon enregistrement.</li>\\n</ul>\"}, \"name\": \"text-block-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 17:48:02','2025-12-10 17:48:02'),(3063,131,4,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-5\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-5\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"My signature below denotes that I have read and understand that my Consent, gives permission to NWAC and its sub-agreement holders to use my images, video and audio as described above.\", \"fr\": \"Ma signature ci-dessous indique que j’ai lu et que je comprends que mon consentement donne la permission à la NWAC et à ses détenteurs de sous-ententes d’utiliser mon image, mes vidéos et mes enregistrements audio tel que décrit ci-dessus.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 17:48:02','2025-12-10 17:48:02'),(3064,131,5,35,'{\"id\": \"legal_submission_sig\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full legal name then press Sign.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez votre nom légal complet, puis appuyez sur Signer.\"}}, \"name\": \"consent_uoiva_sig\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom complet pour signer\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"required\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}}, \"actionLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}}, \"placeholder\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First Last\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom\"}}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}}','2025-12-10 17:48:02','2025-12-10 17:48:02'),(3065,132,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"By signing below, I authorize my training or educational institution, or my employer if my ISET support includes a work placement or wage subsidy, to share information with the Native Women’s Association of Canada (NWAC) and its ISET delivery partners.\", \"fr\": \"En signant ci-dessous, j’autorise mon établissement de formation ou d’enseignement, ou mon employeur si mon soutien ISET comprend un placement ou une subvention salariale, à communiquer des renseignements à l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada (AFAC) et à ses partenaires de prestation du programme ISET.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 17:49:28','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3066,132,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-3\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that this authorization remains in effect unless and until I withdraw it in writing. It applies to information about the funded program, classes, attendance, or wage subsidy under ISET that is funded by Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC).\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que cette autorisation demeure en vigueur tant que je ne la retire pas par écrit. Elle s’applique aux renseignements sur le programme financé, les cours, l’assiduité ou la subvention salariale dans le cadre d’ISET financé par Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC).\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 17:49:28','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3067,132,3,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-4\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"If I decide to withdraw this authorization, I understand that I must notify the Registrar’s Office, my employer, and NWAC or its ISET delivery partner in writing.\", \"fr\": \"Si je décide de retirer cette autorisation, je comprends que je dois en aviser par écrit le Bureau du registraire, mon employeur et l’AFAC ou son partenaire de prestation ISET.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 17:49:28','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3068,132,4,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-5\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-5\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Under applicable access-to-information and privacy laws, I have privacy rights regarding personal information held by government institutions, including educational institutions.\", \"fr\": \"En vertu des lois applicables en matière d’accès à l’information et de protection de la vie privée, j’ai des droits relatifs à la confidentialité des renseignements personnels détenus par les institutions gouvernementales, y compris les établissements d’enseignement.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 17:49:28','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3069,132,5,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-6\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-6\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"My signature confirms that I authorize the institution or employer that received ISET funding or a wage subsidy on my behalf to share the information described above with NWAC or its designate.\", \"fr\": \"Ma signature confirme que j’autorise l’établissement ou l’employeur qui a reçu un financement ISET ou une subvention salariale en mon nom à communiquer les renseignements décrits ci-dessus à l’AFAC ou à son représentant désigné.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-10 17:49:28','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3070,132,6,35,'{\"id\": \"legal_submission_sig\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Type your full legal name and select Sign.\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom légal complet, puis sélectionnez Signer.\"}}, \"name\": \"auth_froici_sing\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom complet pour signer\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"required\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}}, \"actionLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Sign now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}}, \"placeholder\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First name Last name\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom de famille\"}}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}}','2025-12-10 17:49:28','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3183,80,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"What name appears on your identification?\", \"fr\": \"Quel nom figure sur vos pièces d’identité ?\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-12-15 13:41:50','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3184,80,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full legal name as it appears on your identification documents.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez votre nom légal complet tel qu’il figure sur vos pièces d’identité.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body-l\"}','2025-12-15 13:41:50','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3185,80,3,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"name\": \"first-name\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First name\", \"fr\": \"Prénom\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true}, \"autocomplete\": \"given-name\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-15 13:41:50','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3186,80,4,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"name\": \"last-name\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Last name\", \"fr\": \"Nom de famille\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true}, \"autocomplete\": \"family-name\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-15 13:41:50','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3187,80,5,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-3\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Optional.\", \"fr\": \"Facultatif.\"}}, \"name\": \"middle-names\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Middle name(s)\", \"fr\": \"Deuxième(s) prénom(s)\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"autocomplete\": \"additional-name\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-15 13:41:50','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3188,80,6,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-4\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Optional.\", \"fr\": \"Facultatif.\"}}, \"name\": \"preferred-name\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Preferred name (if different)\", \"fr\": \"Prénom usuel (s’il est différent)\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"autocomplete\": \"nickname\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-15 13:41:50','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3200,140,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I, the undersigned, acknowledge that I have been advised by the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders to the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training Program (hereinafter referred to as ISET) that funding for skills and employment training, living allowance, wage subsidies or other sources of funding are Government of Canada resources advanced through Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC) to fund the ISET program.\", \"fr\": \"Je, soussigné(e), reconnais avoir été avisé(e) par l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et/ou ses détenteurs de sous-entente du Programme de formation et d’emploi pour les compétences autochtones (ci-après appelé ISET) que les fonds destinés à la formation en compétences et à l’emploi, à l’allocation de subsistance, aux subventions salariales ou à d’autres sources de financement sont des ressources du gouvernement du Canada avancées par l’entremise d’Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC) pour financer le programme ISET.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-17 09:23:48','2025-12-17 09:23:48'),(3201,140,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I give my consent to the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders and their designated authorized representatives, to contact other service agencies, funding providers, educational and training institutions to verify information regarding my application and for verification of household income sources.\", \"fr\": \"J’autorise l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et/ou ses détenteurs de sous-entente et leurs représentants autorisés désignés à communiquer avec d’autres organismes de services, bailleurs de fonds, établissements d’enseignement et de formation afin de vérifier les renseignements concernant ma demande et pour la vérification des sources de revenu de mon ménage.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-17 09:23:48','2025-12-17 09:23:48'),(3202,140,3,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-3\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Requests for supporting documentation may include but is not limited to: acceptance letter from training institution, letter of decision by Band; ID (Status/Treaty Card, driver’s license, Passport, Health Card or other Government-issued identification); tax assessments; child tax benefit (CTB) statement; Social Assistance statement or letter from agency/caseworker; Record of Employment (ROE); paystubs; letter of employment, bank statements, and other documentation as may be required for verification purposes.\", \"fr\": \"Les demandes de documents à l’appui peuvent inclure, sans toutefois s’y limiter : lettre d’acceptation de l’établissement de formation, lettre de décision du conseil de bande; pièce d’identité (carte de statut/de traité, permis de conduire, passeport, carte Santé ou autre pièce d’identité délivrée par un gouvernement); avis de cotisation; relevé de la prestation fiscale pour enfants (PFE); relevé d’aide sociale ou lettre de l’organisme/travailleur social; relevé d’emploi (RE); talons de paie; lettre d’emploi, relevés bancaires et tout autre document pouvant être exigé à des fins de vérification.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-17 09:23:48','2025-12-17 09:23:48'),(3203,140,4,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-4\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand and acknowledge that any false or misleading statements and/or omission of information by me, may be grounds for immediate suspension of any funding and further, revocation of any funding arrangement between me and the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders, and may result in a repayment of funds to Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC), for monies I received to which I was not entitled.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends et reconnais que toute déclaration fausse ou trompeuse et/ou omission de renseignements de ma part peut constituer un motif de suspension immédiate de tout financement et, de plus, de révocation de toute entente de financement entre moi et l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et/ou ses détenteurs de sous-entente, et peut entraîner le remboursement à Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC) des sommes que j’ai reçues et auxquelles je n’avais pas droit.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-17 09:23:48','2025-12-17 09:23:48'),(3204,140,5,35,'{\"id\": \"legal_submission_sig\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full legal name then press Sign.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez votre nom légal complet, puis appuyez sur « Signer maintenant ».\"}}, \"name\": \"sig_caofs\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign\", \"fr\": \"Inscrivez votre nom complet pour signer\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"required\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}}, \"actionLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}}, \"placeholder\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First Last\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom\"}}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}}','2025-12-17 09:23:48','2025-12-17 09:23:48'),(3239,136,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Wire Transfer Details\", \"fr\": \"Exemple de texte\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-m\"}','2025-12-18 09:36:16','2025-12-18 09:36:16'),(3240,136,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Provide the banking information required for an international or wire-only payment. Only complete this step if your bank does not support EFT or your account is outside Canada.\", \"fr\": \"Exemple de texte\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-12-18 09:36:16','2025-12-18 09:36:16'),(3241,136,3,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"The name of the bank where the wire will be deposited.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"wire-bank-name\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Bank Name\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Required\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-18 09:36:16','2025-12-18 09:36:16'),(3242,136,4,32,'{\"id\": \"example-textarea\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Full address of your bank branch (street, city, country). Often shown on bank letters or online banking.\", \"fr\": \"N\'incluez pas d\'informations personnelles ou financières.\"}}, \"name\": \"wire-bank-address\", \"rows\": 5, \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Bank Address\", \"fr\": \"Champ multi-lignes\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-textarea\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"spellcheck\": true, \"validation\": {\"rules\": [], \"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Required\"}}, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-12-18 09:36:16','2025-12-18 09:36:16'),(3243,136,5,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-3\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter the full account number for the account receiving the wire.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"wire-account-number\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Bank Account Number\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"