": {\"en\": \"Name the source of the income.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez la source du revenu.\"}}, \"name\": \"income-other\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Other income source (if applicable)\", \"fr\": \"Autre source de revenus (s’il y a lieu)\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"text\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2026-01-09 08:55:18','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3589,95,12,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-7\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"mask\": \"currency\", \"name\": \"income-other-description\", \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Other income amount\", \"fr\": \"Montant des autres revenus\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"numeric\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2026-01-09 08:55:18','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(3632,138,1,19,'{\"id\": \"uploaded-file\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Please attach a voided cheque or deposit-slip or confirmation from your bank.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez joindre un chèque annulé ou un bordereau de dépôt ou une confirmation de votre banque.\"}}, \"name\": \"voided-cheque\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Voided Cheque\", \"fr\": \"Chèque annulé\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"classes\": \"\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"showMaxSize\": true, \"documentType\": \"voided_cheque\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"showMimeList\": true, \"documentLabel\": \"Voided Cheque\"}','2026-01-09 12:01:47','2026-01-09 12:01:47'),(3633,142,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <title>Client Funding Agreement</title>\\n  <style>\\n    body {\\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\n      margin: 16px;\\n      line-height: 1.35;\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n    }\\n\\n    h1 {\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\\n    }\\n\\n    h2 {\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n      margin: 18px 0 10px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .field {\\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .field-row {\\n      display: flex;\\n      gap: 16px;\\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .field-row .field {\\n      flex: 1;\\n      margin-bottom: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    .label {\\n      font-weight: bold;\\n      display: block;\\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .field-panel {\\n      border: 1px solid #9ba7b6;\\n      border-radius: 6px;\\n      padding: 8px 10px;\\n      background: #fff;\\n    }\\n\\n    .field-value {\\n      min-height: 24px;\\n      padding: 4px 6px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #9ba7b6;\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n    }\\n\\n    .field-label {\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      color: #4b5563;\\n      margin-top: 6px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .line {\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\\n      min-height: 18px;\\n      padding: 2px 4px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .table-panel {\\n      border: 1px solid #9ba7b6;\\n      border-radius: 8px;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      margin-top: 8px;\\n      background: #fff;\\n    }\\n\\n    table {\\n      border-collapse: collapse;\\n      width: 100%;\\n    }\\n\\n    th, td {\\n      border: 1px solid #9ba7b6;\\n      padding: 6px;\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n    }\\n\\n    th {\\n      text-align: left;\\n      font-weight: bold;\\n      background: #f6f7f9;\\n    }\\n\\n    .amount {\\n      width: 30%;\\n      white-space: nowrap;\\n    }\\n\\n    .note {\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      margin-top: 6px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .intervention-panel {\\n      border: 1px solid #9ba7b6;\\n      border-radius: 8px;\\n      padding: 10px 12px;\\n      background: #fff;\\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .redline-badge {\\n      display: inline-block;\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      border: 1px solid #9ba7b6;\\n      border-radius: 10px;\\n      padding: 2px 6px;\\n      margin-right: 6px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .redline-added {\\n      border-color: #2f855a;\\n      background: #f0fff4;\\n    }\\n\\n    .redline-removed {\\n      border-color: #a61d24;\\n      background: #fff1f2;\\n      text-decoration: line-through;\\n    }\\n\\n    .redline-added-badge {\\n      color: #2f855a;\\n      border-color: #2f855a;\\n    }\\n\\n    .redline-removed-badge {\\n      color: #a61d24;\\n      border-color: #a61d24;\\n    }\\n\\n    .redline-modified-badge {\\n      color: #1d4ed8;\\n      border-color: #1d4ed8;\\n    }\\n\\n    .intervention-title {\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .intervention-meta {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      gap: 10px 18px;\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .label-inline {\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      margin-right: 4px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .empty-state {\\n      border: 1px dashed #9ba7b6;\\n      border-radius: 6px;\\n      padding: 10px 12px;\\n      color: #4b5563;\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      background: #fafafa;\\n    }\\n\\n    .living-panel {\\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .living-title {\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .signature-block {\\n      margin-top: 18px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .signature-panel {\\n      border: 1px solid #9ba7b6;\\n      border-radius: 6px;\\n      padding: 12px;\\n      max-width: 520px;\\n      background: #fff;\\n    }\\n\\n    .signature-line {\\n      min-height: 24px;\\n      padding: 4px 6px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #9ba7b6;\\n    }\\n\\n    .signature-name {\\n      font-family: \'Segoe Script\', \'Lucida Handwriting\', cursive;\\n      font-size: 18px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .signature-meta {\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      color: #4b5563;\\n      margin-top: 6px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .footer {\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      margin-top: 16px;\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"field-panel\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"field-value\\\">{{client_name}}</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"field-label\\\">Client Name (please print)</div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<h2>Approved funding</h2>\\n{{{interventions_html}}}\\n<div class=\\\"note\\\">\\n  Details include payable timing, installment cadence, payee, and any note provided.\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- IF funding_total -->\\n<div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"field-panel\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"field-value\\\">{{funding_total}}</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"field-label\\\">Total approved funding</div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n<!-- END funding_total -->\\n\\n<div class=\\\"note\\\">\\n  <strong>**</strong> Payment of tuition-related expenses will be paid to the Educational/Training institution(s) named above,\\n  and reimbursed to the Client only with original paid receipts.\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- IF living_allowance_sections_html -->\\n<h2>Living Allowance (if applicable)</h2>\\n\\n{{{living_allowance_sections_html}}}\\n\\n<div class=\\\"note\\\">\\n  <strong>*</strong> Client Monthly Attendance Report MUST be submitted before a living allowance is paid.\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"note\\\">\\n  <strong>**</strong> It takes 4-6 business days to process your living allowance after receiving your Attendance Report.\\n</div>\\n<!-- END living_allowance_sections_html -->\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-top:14px;\\\">\\n  I, as the Client receiving funding under the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training program and signing my name below,\\n  understand and acknowledge that any false or misleading statements and/or omission of information may result in\\n  suspension or revocation of this funding agreement and repayment of funds to Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC).\\n</p>\\n\\n<!-- IF client_signature -->\\n<div class=\\\"signature-block\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"label\\\">Client Signature</span>\\n  <div class=\\\"signature-panel\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"signature-line signature-name\\\">{{client_signature}}</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"signature-meta\\\">Signed on {{client_signed_date}}</div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n<!-- END client_signature -->\\n\\n<!-- IF show_case_manager_signature -->\\n<div class=\\\"signature-block\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"label\\\">Case Manager Signature</span>\\n  <div class=\\\"signature-panel\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"signature-line signature-name\\\">{{case_manager_signature}}</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"signature-meta\\\">Signed on {{case_manager_signed_date}}</div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n<!-- END show_case_manager_signature -->\\n\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Example text\", \"fr\": \"Exemple de texte\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2026-01-10 13:10:58','2026-03-10 14:43:01'),(3634,142,2,35,'{\"id\": \"legal_submission_sig\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full legal name then press Sign.\"}}, \"name\": \"client-sig\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Client Signature\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"required\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Clear\"}}, \"actionLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\"}}, \"placeholder\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First Last\"}}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Signed\"}}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\"}}}','2026-01-10 13:10:58','2026-01-10 13