ing fees. Do not include home repairs, property taxes, or insurance.\", \"fr\": \"Votre part du loyer mensuel ou des paiements hypothécaires pour votre résidence principale, y compris les frais de logement obligatoires. N’incluez pas les réparations domiciliaires, les taxes foncières ou l’assurance.\"}}, \"name\": \"expenses-rent\", \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Rent/Mortgage\", \"fr\": \"Loyer/Hypothèque\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"numeric\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2026-02-21 09:23:51','2026-02-21 09:23:51'),(4366,97,4,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-3\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Include basic food items, fresh produce, bread, dairy, meat, pantry staples, and essential household supplies— not including takeout, restaurants, or alcohol.\", \"fr\": \"Incluez les aliments de base, les produits frais, le pain, les produits laitiers, la viande, les aliments de garde-manger et les fournitures ménagères essentielles—sans inclure la restauration à emporter, les restaurants ou l’alcool.\"}}, \"name\": \"expenses-groceries\", \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Groceries\", \"fr\": \"Épicerie\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"numeric\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2026-02-21 09:23:51','2026-02-21 09:23:51'),(4367,97,5,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Monthly electricity bill from a public utility or prepaid electricity.\", \"fr\": \"Facture mensuelle d’électricité d’une entreprise de services publics ou électricité prépayée.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"expenses-electricity\", \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Electricity/Hydro\", \"fr\": \"Électricité/Hydro\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"numeric\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2026-02-21 09:23:51','2026-02-21 09:23:51'),(4368,97,6,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-7\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Include costs such as natural gas, heating oil, propane, wood, pellets, or generator fuel when it is your main heat or power source.\", \"fr\": \"Incluez les coûts comme le gaz naturel, le mazout, le propane, le bois, les granules ou le carburant de génératrice lorsqu’il s’agit de votre principale source de chauffage ou d’énergie.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"expenses-heating\", \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Home Heating\", \"fr\": \"Chauffage domestique\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--s\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"numeric\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2026-02-21 09:23:51','2026-03-16 12:39:51'),(4369,97,7,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input-8\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"E.g. municipal water charges, rural water delivery / trucked water, or community co-op or band-managed water fees charged to 